<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:05a5c435-3e4f-4372-974f-6ee60d1997ef">
              <SHORT-NAME>Dcm</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the Dcm (Diagnostic Communications Manager) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Dcm（Diagnostic Communication Manager）是AUTOSAR中负责管理车辆诊断通信的模块，它支持不同的诊断协议并处理来自外部测试设备的诊断请求。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置Dcm模块时，需要确保其与ECU的诊断需求和支持的诊断协议相匹配；Dcm配置参数必须符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的属性和结构；在多ECU系统中，应注意Dcm的网络管理和会话控制策略，以保证诊断通信的正确性和高效性。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01082</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:14704446-8e97-4037-be04-cdf9dd6c0f07">
                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmConfigSet</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters and sub containers of the DCM module supporting multiple configuration sets.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmConfigSet是用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）的配置集，包括诊断服务、会话控制、安全访问等相关参数的设置，以支持车辆的诊断通信需求。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmConfigSet时，需要确保所有诊断服务的参数与车辆的诊断需求相匹配；对于安全访问和会话控制的配置，应考虑其对车辆安全性的影响；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对诊断服务的配置和管理提供了详细的指导，应遵循这些指导以确保配置的正确性和有效性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00819</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1a9bb7bc-401c-4735-bef3-c018f7bcfe36">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsd</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">These parameters configure the Diagnostic Service Dispatcher submodule.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsd（Diagnostic Session Dictionary）是AUTOSAR诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）的配置项，用于定义诊断服务表，包括服务标识符、子功能以及对应的处理函数。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsd时，必须确保每个诊断服务的标识符和子功能的组合是唯一的，以避免在诊断会话中的冲突；应当根据实际的车辆诊断需求来配置DcmDsd，确保所有必要的诊断服务都被正确定义；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，DcmDsd的配置应当遵循模块的最新规范，包括对服务处理函数的引用和诊断服务的权限管理。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00688</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:173a629f-de23-4819-a3f1-123c64ec9592">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdServiceRequestManufacturerNotification</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The name of this container is used to define the name of the R-Port through which the DCM accesses the interface ServiceRequestNotification.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdServiceRequestManufacturerNotification配置项用于定义在执行诊断服务请求时，如何通知制造商特定的软件模块。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需要确保通知机制与制造商的软件模块兼容；此配置项应与诊断服务表（DSD）中的其他配置保持一致；在实施时应注意不同OEM的特定要求和标准。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The R-Port is named ServiceRequestManufacturerNotification_{Name} where {Name} is the name of the container DcmDsdServiceRequestManufacturerNotification.

                                                The  lowerMultiplicity is 0: If container DcmDsdServiceRequestManufacturerNotification does not exist the  Indication API is not available.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00681</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:974b9deb-2065-4b27-b301-781bb15640cf">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdServiceRequestSupplierNotification</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The name of this container is used to define the name of the R-Port through which the DCM accesses the interface ServiceRequestNotification.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdServiceRequestSupplierNotification配置项用于定义诊断服务分发（DSD）模块在接收到服务请求后，如何通知供应商（即服务处理模块）。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保通知机制与诊断服务处理模块的实现相兼容；通知策略应当支持同步和异步两种模式，以适应不同的服务处理需求；配置时应注意不同服务请求对通知时序和性能的影响。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The R-Port is named ServiceRequestSupplierNotification_&lt;SWC&gt;
                                                where &lt;SWC&gt; is the name of the container DcmDsdServiceRequestSupplierNotification.

                                                The  lowerMultiplicity is 0: If the container DcmDsdRequestSupplierNotification does not exist the Indication API is not available.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00816</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:aa9cd4bb-b42c-4989-8c88-14b293db1230">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdServiceTable</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (DSD parameters) for a Service Identifier Table.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdServiceTable配置项用于定义诊断服务分发表，它指定了哪些诊断服务（通过服务标识符）被分配到哪个诊断服务分发器（DSD）下，以及它们对应的处理函数。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个服务标识符在DcmDsdServiceTable中唯一，以避免服务处理的冲突；在配置服务处理函数时，需考虑其执行时间，以满足系统的实时性要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对服务的分发有明确规范，需要确保配置与标准一致。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Note: It is allowed to add OBD services to a DcmDsdServiceTable related to a UDS Protocol. But it is not allowed to add UDS services to a DcmDsdServiceTable related to an OBD Protocol.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00732</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>256</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9beecb56-9c72-48f2-8937-081b15498799">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSidTabId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Due to using possibly more service tables, the unique DcmDsdSidTabId can be used to identify them.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSidTabId 是用于标识诊断服务表（Diagnostic Service Table）的唯一标识符，它关联了一组特定的服务识别符（Service Identifier, SID）和对应的诊断服务处理程序。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdSidTabId时，必须确保每个诊断服务表的标识符是唯一的，以避免在诊断会话中的冲突；此外，该标识符通常由诊断配置工具自动生成，应避免手动修改以防止潜在的配置错误；在整个诊断系统中，应保持对应关系的一致性，确保诊断请求能够被正确解析和处理。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00736</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b5c531c1-fb24-4f9f-bf59-261058c79cf9">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdService</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (DSD parameters) for a Service.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdService配置项定义了诊断服务调度层（Diagnostic Service Dispatcher）中的一个诊断服务，包括服务标识符（Service Identifier）和该服务所关联的子功能。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdService时，需要确保服务标识符的唯一性，避免与其他诊断服务冲突；还需关联正确的诊断服务处理器（Service Handler）和子功能，以保证诊断请求能够被正确处理；此外，应考虑服务的安全访问权限，确保只有在适当的诊断会话和安全等级下才能访问该服务。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00689</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4f912f4c-9346-47ab-a542-5fdee942ce2d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdServiceUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Allows to activate or deactivate the usage of a Service. This parameter can be used for multi-purpose ECUs.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdServiceUsed是一个配置参数，用于定义诊断服务调度器（Diagnostic Service Dispatcher）中所使用的诊断服务。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdServiceUsed时，需要确保只有在DcmDsd中声明的服务才能被使用；此外，每个服务应当与正确的子功能和请求长度匹配；最后，确保服务的安全访问权限设置符合项目的安全需求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">true - service is available

                                                                false - service is not available</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01044</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:240938a3-1bb7-4aef-8bc4-ff8ef293f1b0">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSidTabSubfuncAvail</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Information about whether the service has subfunctions or not. This parameter is used for the handling of the &quot;suppressPosRspMsgIndicationBit&quot; as defined in ISO 14229-1, which can be used as a reference for the configuration.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSidTabSubfuncAvail配置项用于定义在诊断服务表中，特定服务标识符（SID）下支持的子功能的可用性。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置子功能可用性时，需要确保只有那些确实由ECU支持的子功能被标记为可用；不正确的配置可能导致诊断工具无法正确与ECU通信；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的诊断协议标准（如ISO 14229）来配置子功能的可用性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">true - service has subfunctions, suppressPosRspMsgIndicationBit is available

                                                                false - service has no subfunctions, suppressPosRspMsgIndicationBit is not available</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00737</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:a926b0f5-720e-43d0-a7c6-b2169c427a55">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSidTabFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Callback function of the ECU Supplier specific component for the particular service. The function's prototype is as described for &lt;Module&gt;_&lt;DiagnosticService&gt;. If this parameter is not configured, the service is handled Dcm-internally.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSidTabFnc配置项用于定义诊断服务表中服务标识符（SID）对应的功能处理函数，它指定了当接收到特定SID时，应当调用的函数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdSidTabFnc时，需要确保每个服务标识符对应一个唯一的功能处理函数；处理函数需要符合AUTOSAR标准中定义的接口要求；在配置多个服务标识符时，要注意避免SID之间的冲突。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00777</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                  </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5fb5c6d9-6d51-4172-aaa3-ffd358b13651">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdServiceRole</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Bitfield were each bit represents one dedicated role. A diagnostic service is granted access if the bit value is 1. If a bit value is 0, the service is not allowed to be executed for that role.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdServiceRole配置项定义了诊断服务在诊断服务调度器（DSD）中的角色，用于指定该服务是供应商特定的服务还是标准服务，以及它是否需要会话控制或安全访问控制。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdServiceRole时，必须确保服务角色与实际的服务需求相匹配；对于需要会话控制或安全访问的服务，应正确配置相关属性以确保服务的安全性和有效性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对服务角色的定义和使用有明确规范，需要遵循这些规范以保证诊断服务的正确实现。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01139</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
