                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2ecd1da7-2e54-40a1-a7c7-5afe7ae9a702">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSidTabServiceId</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Identifier of the service.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSidTabServiceId配置项用于定义诊断服务表中的服务标识符（Service Identifier, SID），它指定了哪些服务ID将被诊断会话层处理。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdSidTabServiceId时，需要确保服务ID与实际的诊断服务匹配，并且在同一诊断服务表中服务ID是唯一的；此外，服务ID应遵循ISO 14229和OEM特定的诊断服务ID规范；在配置过程中还应注意与DcmDsdSubServiceId的关联性，确保子服务ID的正确配置和使用。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The possible service identifiers are defined in ISO 14229-1 and ISO 15031-5.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00735</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8873829f-13b9-49f4-b0b0-7e103063f164">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSidTabModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a DcmDspModeRule which controls the execution of the service. If there is no reference configured, no mode rule check shall be performed.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSidTabModeRuleRef配置项用于引用特定的诊断会话控制模式规则，这些规则定义了在哪些诊断会话模式下，特定的服务标识符（SID）是有效的。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdSidTabModeRuleRef时，需要确保引用的模式规则与诊断服务表中定义的服务兼容；引用的模式规则必须在Dcm配置中预先定义；正确配置模式规则对于确保诊断服务的正确访问权限至关重要。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00918</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmProcessingConditions/DcmModeRule</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:b78f43b0-f009-482f-929e-4ea2d39bae99">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSidTabSecurityLevelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Security Level in which the service is allowed to be executed. Multiple references are allowed for a service.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSidTabSecurityLevelRef配置项用于将特定的诊断服务标识符（SID）表与相应的安全等级关联起来，确保只有在满足特定安全条件时才能访问和执行这些服务。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的安全等级已经在Dcm的安全策略中定义；每个SID表应该引用至少一个安全等级，以保证服务的安全访问；在实施配置时，应考虑与诊断会话控制的安全等级配合使用，以实现更细粒度的访问控制。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Please refer to ISO 14229-1, ISO 15031-5 and chapter &quot;Verification of the Service Security Access levels.&quot;

                                                                If there is no reference configured, no service security verification shall be performed.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00733</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspSecurity/DcmDspSecurityRow</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:81cc0afc-a973-461a-a081-6d35e3abf6a0">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSidTabSessionLevelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Session Level in which the service is allowed to be executed. Multiple references are allowed for a service.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSidTabSessionLevelRef配置项用于定义诊断服务标识符（SID）表中的服务可以在哪些诊断会话级别下被访问。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保配置的会话级别与服务的实际需求相匹配；不同的服务可能需要在不同的诊断会话级别下可用；在配置时要考虑到诊断会话控制逻辑，以确保服务在适当的会话级别下被正确地授权或限制。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Please refer to ISO 14229-1, ISO 15031-5 and chapter &quot;Verification of the Diagnostic Session&quot;.

                                                                If there is no reference configured, no diagnostic session verification shall be performed.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00734</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
