                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspSession/DcmDspSessionRow</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:933e79e0-afb0-4e61-b24d-4186366ff81e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubService</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (DSD parameters) for a subservice of a service. Only those services may have subservices, which have the DcmDsdSidTabSubfuncAvail configured as TRUE.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSubService配置项用于定义诊断服务中的子服务信息，包括子服务的标识符、相关条件以及对应的处理函数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdSubService时，需要确保子服务标识符的唯一性，以避免在同一诊断服务中出现冲突；子服务处理函数应当与子服务的功能和要求相匹配，确保正确响应诊断请求；还需考虑安全访问条件，确保只有在满足特定条件下才能执行子服务。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00802</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4c3b0201-958c-4428-800e-39b28447f982">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubServiceUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Allows to activate or deactivate the usage of a Subservice. This parameter can be used for multi-purpose ECUs.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSubServiceUsed配置项用于指定在诊断会话控制中，哪些子服务应被激活或使用。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保只有在需要的诊断会话中激活相应的子服务，以避免不必要的资源消耗；子服务的配置应符合车辆制造商的诊断策略和安全要求；在配置时需遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对诊断服务的具体要求和限制。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">true - subservice is available
                                                                        false - subservice is not available.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01047</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:9f1573fc-4fbb-4bcd-8ed1-8abeb89f0239">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubServiceFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Callback function of the ECU Supplier specific component for the particular service. The function's prototype is as described for &lt;Module&gt;_&lt;DiagnosticService&gt;_&lt;SubService&gt;.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSubServiceFnc配置项用于定义诊断子服务的处理函数，这些函数负责执行与特定诊断子服务相关的操作。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保为每个诊断子服务正确配置对应的处理函数，避免诊断功能执行错误；处理函数需要遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的接口规范；在配置处理函数时，考虑其执行时间对系统性能的影响，以免影响整体诊断响应时间。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                        <SDGS>
                                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                          </SDG>
                                        </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">If this parameter is not configured, the subservice is handled Dcm-internally.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00942</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                      </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0155da7f-18d0-4a34-af5f-960c59a2edfa">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubServiceId</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Identifier of the subservice.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSubServiceId配置项用于定义诊断服务中子服务的唯一标识符，这个标识符用于区分不同的子服务，以便在诊断会话中正确处理各种子服务请求。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置子服务时，必须确保每个子服务的标识符是唯一的，以避免在诊断服务分派时发生冲突；子服务标识符通常是一个字节大小的值，因此它的取值范围应该在0x00到0xFF之间；在配置子服务标识符时，还需要考虑与全局服务标识符的关系，确保它们在诊断服务分派器中能够被正确解析和处理。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The possible subservice identifiers are defined in ISO 14229-1 and ISO 15031-5.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00803</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>127</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4e41442b-d07f-477d-8f63-2e6ed0c6608c">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubServiceRole</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Bitfield were each bit represents one dedicated role. A sub-function of a diagnostic service is granted access if the bit value is 1. If a bit value is 0, the service is not allowed to be executed for that role.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSubServiceRole配置项定义了诊断子服务在诊断服务调度器（DSD）中的角色，用于控制子服务的执行权限和行为。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsdSubServiceRole时，需要确保子服务的角色与其预期的行为一致；角色类型通常包括默认角色、功能请求角色和物理请求角色；在配置时应注意不同角色对安全访问级别的要求。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                        <SDGS>
                                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                          </SDG>
                                        </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01140</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:7fa929fc-6556-4b06-a420-f2a0f4354812">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubServiceModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a DcmDspModeRule which controls the execution of the subservice.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSubServiceModeRuleRef配置项用于引用一个特定的诊断会话模式规则，该规则定义了在哪些诊断会话模式下子服务可以被执行。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的会话模式规则与子服务的实际需求相匹配；在配置时应注意不同诊断服务之间的会话模式规则可能存在冲突；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，会话模式规则需要在Dcm配置中明确定义，并且正确关联到相应的子服务。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">If there is no reference configured, no mode rule check shall be performed.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00924</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmProcessingConditions/DcmModeRule</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6380056f-86e0-441f-b907-a20058747a61">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubServiceSecurityLevelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Security Level in which the subservice is allowed to be executed. Multiple references are allowed for a subservice.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSubServiceSecurityLevelRef配置项用于定义诊断子服务的安全级别，确保只有在满足特定安全条件下才能访问这些子服务。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保安全级别与子服务的安全需求相匹配；不正确的安全级别配置可能导致未授权的访问或功能受限；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，安全级别的配置应详细且清晰，避免安全漏洞。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Please refer to ISO 14229-1, ISO 15031-5 and chapter &quot;Verification of the Service Security Access levels.&quot;

                                                                        If there is no reference configured, no subservice security verification shall be performed.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00812</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspSecurity/DcmDspSecurityRow</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f7ec7457-910f-4574-995d-70aaae918ec8">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubServiceSessionLevelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Session Level in which the subservice is allowed to be executed. Multiple references are allowed for a subservice.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsdSubServiceSessionLevelRef配置项用于指定诊断子服务（SubService）可以在哪些诊断会话级别（Diagnostic Session Level）下被执行，确保诊断服务的执行符合当前会话级别的权限要求。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保为每个诊断子服务正确配置会话级别，避免在不允许的会话级别下执行诊断操作；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，会话级别的配置应遵循诊断服务需求，不正确的配置可能导致诊断服务无法在特定会话级别下执行；在配置时，应参考相关诊断协议标准，如ISO 14229等，以确保兼容性和标准的遵循。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Please refer to ISO 14229-1, ISO 15031-5 and chapter &quot;Verification of the Diagnostic Session&quot;.

                                                                        If there is no reference configured, no diagnostic session verification shall be performed.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00804</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspSession/DcmDspSessionRow</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
