                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:31e1c6b4-7af9-47b6-8b8a-c97060a23b96">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsl</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">These parameters configure the Diagnostic Session Layer submodule.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDsl（Diagnostic Communication Manager Diagnostic Session Layer）是AUTOSAR中负责管理诊断通信会话层的配置项，它定义了诊断服务请求和响应之间的通信规则，以及与客户端（通常是诊断工具）的交互方式。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDsl时，需确保与车辆的诊断协议和诊断需求相匹配；注意DcmDsl配置与DcmDsd（Diagnostic Service Dispatcher）和DcmDsp（Diagnostic Service Processor）的交互关系；在配置诊断会话控制、测试仪器控制和网络管理等功能时，应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准的相关规定。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00690</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d3c108f7-a9c9-4f26-9db6-97f537987200">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslBuffer</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a diagnostic buffer.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslBuffer配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的缓冲区，这些缓冲区用于存储发送或接收的诊断消息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：缓冲区大小应根据实际需求和最大可能的诊断消息长度来配置，以避免溢出；确保每个缓冲区的唯一性和正确的关联到相应的DcmDslProtocol；在多客户端环境中，管理缓冲区的分配和释放以防止数据冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00739</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>256</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d81e0b3b-8707-44cf-b1e3-d462b775354c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslBufferSize</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Size of the diagnostic buffer in bytes.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslBufferSize配置项用于指定诊断会话层（Diagnostic Session Layer）中用于存储接收和发送诊断消息的缓冲区大小。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：缓冲区大小应足够容纳最大可能的诊断请求和响应消息；过小的缓冲区可能导致消息处理失败，过大的缓冲区可能会浪费资源；在配置时需考虑ECU的内存限制和诊断需求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">For a linear buffer the size shall be as large as the longest diagnostic message (request or response).

                                                        For a paged buffer the size has impacts on the application performance.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00738</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>8</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:7f4be424-4857-499b-8a53-dc8511be24b9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslCallbackDCMRequestService</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Each DcmDslCallbackDCMRequestService container defines an R-Port with the CallbackDCMRequestServices interface which the Dcm uses to ask permission for protocol changes from the application software. The R-Port has the name CallbackDCMRequestServices_&lt;SWC&gt; where &lt;SWC&gt; is the name of this container.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslCallbackDCMRequestService配置项用于定义诊断服务请求时的回调函数，这些回调函数在诊断请求的不同阶段被调用，以实现特定的功能，如权限控制、服务处理前后的操作等。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保回调函数与服务请求处理流程兼容；回调函数应遵循AUTOSAR规定的接口和行为模式；在多服务处理场景中，应注意回调函数的执行顺序和资源共享问题。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00679</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:511b6d0c-5ba5-45bd-8b9a-ac53af438c81">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslDiagResp</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of the automatic requestCorrectlyReceivedResponsePending response management in the Dcm.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslDiagResp配置项定义了诊断响应消息的发送行为，包括消息的优先级、缓冲区大小和发送策略，确保诊断响应能够按照既定的方式被正确处理和发送。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslDiagResp时，必须确保为每个诊断请求设置合适的响应优先级，以避免重要信息的延迟；缓冲区大小应根据实际需要合理设置，以防止数据溢出或资源浪费；发送策略的选择应考虑网络带宽和系统处理能力，以优化诊断通信性能。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00691</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ad89b9eb-2ea1-41a5-911b-3bfaebbc2145">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslDiagRespOnSecondDeclinedRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the reaction upon a second request (ClientB) that can not be processed (e.g. due to priority assessment).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslDiagRespOnSecondDeclinedRequest配置项用于定义诊断服务层（DcmDsl）在连续两次请求被拒绝时的响应行为，确保了对异常请求的处理符合诊断通信管理的要求。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项对于确保诊断通信的健壮性和安全性至关重要；必须确保配置正确以避免潜在的通信安全风险；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的属性和行为应详细参照相关诊断通信管理规范进行配置。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">TRUE: when the second request (Client B) can not be processed, it shall be answered with NRC21 BusyRepeatRequest.

                                                        FALSE: when the second request (Client B) can not be processed, it shall not be responded.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00914</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b5ef0f10-320b-42b0-a444-40aceeaf5162">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslDiagRespMaxNumRespPend</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Maximum number of negative responses with response code 0x78 (requestCorrectlyReceivedResponsePending) allowed for a request. If Dcm reaches this limit, an automatic 0x10 (generalReject) final response will be trasmitted and the service processing will be cancelled.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslDiagRespMaxNumRespPend 定义了在等待诊断响应期间，诊断通信管理器（DCM）可以发送的最大“响应待定”消息数量。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该参数的设置应考虑ECU处理能力和网络带宽，以避免通信拥堵；过高的设置可能导致客户端超时错误；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中此配置项的默认值和范围应严格遵守以保证诊断通信的可靠性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00693</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:9f1573fc-4fbb-4bcd-8ed1-8abeb89f0239">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslDiagResponseIndicationFunc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">DcmDslDiagResponseIndicationFunc defines the function interface for passing the diagnostic response data to the user to do debugging related work during the transmission of the diagnostic response data.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslDiagResponseIndicationFunc定义了在传输诊断响应数据的过程中，将诊断响应数据传递给用户做调试相关工作的函数接口。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：此配置为非标配置项，仅为用户调试过程中所使用，如果正常量产应用则需要关闭该接口，即不设置该接口的函数名。 </L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">If this parameter is not configured, the subservice is handled Dcm-internally.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01042</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                              </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:59c68709-cd07-4aaf-b6be-854c02680207">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocol</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configurations of the diagnostic protocols used in Dcm.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocol配置项定义了诊断通信层协议的属性，包括诊断协议类型（如UDS，OBD等），以及与之相关的通信参数和定时器设置。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocol时，需要确保选择的协议类型与车辆标准和法规要求相匹配；同时，通信参数和定时器设置必须满足诊断协议的性能要求；此外，应注意与网络层的兼容性和整个诊断系统的一致性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00694</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b21e715e-7eda-4858-b546-be23bf80f231">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRow</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of one particular diagnostic protocol used in Dcm.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRow配置项定义了诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的协议行，它指定了诊断协议层的配置，如ISO TP、KWP2000等，以及这些协议的相关参数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolRow时，需要确保协议参数与实际使用的诊断协议标准一致；应注意与DcmDslProtocol配置的一致性和兼容性；在多协议系统中，还需确保不同DcmDslProtocolRow之间的参数设置不会相互冲突。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00695</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:066e696e-146a-4194-983f-3e291cb74072">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRowUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Allows to activate or deactivate the usage of a Protocol. This parameter can be used for multi-purpose ECUs.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRowUsed配置项用于指定诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中使用的协议行，它定义了诊断会话层协议（如ISO 14229, ISO 15765等）的具体实现和行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolRowUsed时，需要确保所选协议与车辆支持的诊断协议一致；每个DcmDslProtocolRow配置必须关联到至少一个DcmDslProtocol，以确保正确的协议行被激活；在多协议系统中，应注意协议之间的优先级和切换逻辑，以避免潜在的冲突。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">true - protocol is available

                                                                false - protocol is not available.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01043</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:918cf9be-5ec4-4c10-8093-2da07bfa3c15">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmSendRespPendOnRestart</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">If set to TRUE, the Dcm will send a NRC 0x78 before a transition to bootloader or performing an ECU reset. If set to False, no 0x78 is send in this case.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSendRespPendOnRestart配置项用于定义诊断通信管理模块（Diagnostic Communication Manager, DCM）在ECU重启后是否发送响应挂起（Response Pending）消息。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的使用需要谨慎，确保在ECU重启过程中对诊断请求的处理符合预期；重启行为可能会影响诊断会话的连续性，因此需要特别注意会话管理；此配置项的使用应结合具体的应用场景和ECU的诊断策略来决定。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01114</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ee55786f-ff34-4b07-aa2e-23efed6af829">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolTransType</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter is used only if the protocol is of type DCM_ROE_ON_xxx. It selects the transmission type of the protocol.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolTransType 定义了诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中使用的传输类型，如正常、周期性或响应式传输。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolTransType时，必须确保所选传输类型与车辆网络的支持和诊断需求相匹配；不正确的传输类型配置可能导致诊断通信失败或性能下降；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准支持多种传输类型，应详细了解每种类型的适用场景。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00700</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>TYPE1</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <LITERALS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:86407bfd-b1cb-8c64-455b-0f43989d53ae">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>TYPE1</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:93abf0ec-c21d-9006-596a-0a78b548381e">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>TYPE2</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                  </LITERALS>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d2e9a746-4603-4eb2-bb78-1ce1f27c40bf">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolType</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">The diagnostic protocol type for the DCM DSL protocol that is being configured.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolType配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中使用的诊断协议类型，如ISO 14229 (UDS) 或 ISO 15765 (DoCAN)。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolType时，必须确保选择的协议类型与车辆的诊断需求和规范相匹配；不同的协议类型可能会要求不同的配置参数和服务集；在实施时，应考虑与其他诊断协议的兼容性和共存问题。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Implementation Type: Dcm_ProtocolType</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01110</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>DCM_UDS_ON_CAN</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <LITERALS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:e1309f6b-f50f-89b0-38e8-c27fe653d37c">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_OBD_ON_CAN</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:ef6fcb01-9fea-8cec-5995-688883321d3f">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_OBD_ON_IP</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:8f5435b3-0662-8c86-459b-e5b0946fa11c">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_UDS_ON_CAN</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:6c1d4eb1-e230-8bff-612e-3ce88e6b6e4b">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_UDS_ON_IP</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                  </LITERALS>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7cef3399-32d4-4350-9460-9fe50c5b50c4">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmTimStrP2ServerAdjust</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter is used to guarantee that the diagnostic response is available on the bus before reaching P2 by adjusting the current DcmDspSessionP2ServerMax.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmTimStrP2ServerAdjust 用于调整诊断通信中服务器的P2定时器，这是响应客户端请求后服务器在规定时间内必须给出响应的时间。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值必须根据具体的车辆网络环境和诊断需求进行调整；不正确的P2Server时间设置可能导致诊断通信失败或性能下降；应遵循OEM的具体规定和标准来设置此参数。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">This parameter mainly represents the software architecture dependent communication delay between the time the transmission is initiated by DCM and the time when the message is actually transmitted to the bus.

                                                                The parameter value is defined in seconds and must be a multiple of DcmTaskTime.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00729</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">1</MAX>
                                  <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:583f1d3e-dcdb-4457-b871-283eb8dc56f4">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmTimStrP2StarServerAdjust</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter is used to guarantee that the diagnostic response is available on the bus before reaching P2Star by adjusting the current DcmDspSessionP2StarServerMax.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmTimStrP2StarServerAdjust配置项用于调整诊断通信控制器（Diagnostics Communication Manager）中的P2*服务器定时器，该定时器定义了服务器在发送响应之前等待客户端请求的最大时间。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值通常需要根据具体的车辆网络环境和诊断需求进行调整；过小的值可能导致网络拥堵时无法正确响应诊断请求，过大的值可能导致诊断响应延迟；在调整此参数时，应遵循相关的诊断标准和制造商的指导。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">This parameter mainly represents the software architecture dependent communication delay between the time the transmission is initiated by DCM and the time when the message is actually transmitted to the bus.

                                                                The parameter value is defined in seconds and must be a multiple of DcmTaskTime.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00728</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">5</MAX>
                                  <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:21ec72bf-670f-442f-9098-dd6376890743">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolMaximumResponseSize</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter is mandatory and defines the maximum length of the response message in case DcmPagedBufferEnabled == TRUE</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolMaximumResponseSize配置项用于定义诊断通信层中，针对每个诊断协议所能支持的最大响应报文大小，确保诊断响应不会超过ECU的缓冲区限制。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保该值不小于诊断服务的最大可能响应长度；同时考虑到网络层的限制，如ISO TP的单帧或多帧传输限制；此外，该值应小于或等于ECU硬件和网络接口的最大承载能力。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01020</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>4095</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                  <MIN>1</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:97a22d8f-b8f4-4b67-b998-03c32d375733">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolPriority</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Protocol priority used during protocol preemption. A higher priority protocol may preempt a lower priority protocol.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolPriority配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中不同诊断协议之间的优先级，以决定在多个诊断请求同时到达时哪个协议应该被优先处理。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时必须确保每个诊断协议都有一个唯一的优先级值；优先级的配置应该反映实际的系统需求，确保关键诊断服务能够优先处理；在实际应用中，应考虑到不同车辆网络（如CAN, LIN, FlexRay等）的特性和要求，合理分配优先级。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Lower numeric values represent higher protocol priority:

                                                                0 - Highest protocol priority

                                                                255 - Lowest protocol priority</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00699</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>1</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3c4af487-028d-4bc7-9e4f-894392696d8b">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspProtocolEcuAddr</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Ecu source address used for diagnostic communication. This parameter is required for Generic Connections.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspProtocolEcuAddr配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，针对不同诊断协议的ECU地址信息，确保诊断请求能够正确地被ECU识别和处理。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspProtocolEcuAddr时，需要确保地址信息与车辆网络中的实际地址匹配；对于使用相同诊断协议的不同ECU，应有不同的地址配置以避免冲突；此配置项应与车辆的网络管理配置保持一致，以确保诊断服务的正确路由。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01081</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:0093d0e5-643f-4d01-964c-d7559d571dd5">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDemClientRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DemClient in Dem configuration.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDemClientRef是一个配置项，用于在诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager, DCM）模块中引用诊断事件管理器（Diagnostic Event Manager, DEM）的客户端标识符，实现DCM与DEM之间的交互。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的DEM客户端标识符在DEM模块中已定义，以保证DCM能正确访问DEM服务；在配置时应注意版本兼容性，确保DCM和DEM模块遵循相同或兼容的AUTOSAR版本；在多客户端系统中，正确管理每个DCM客户端与DEM的关联，避免配置错误导致诊断服务失败。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Used by the Dem to distinguish different client calls.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01083</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dem/DemGeneral/DemClient</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8f317384-bf9f-459f-893a-fa79d90a660b">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRxBufferRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a configured diagnostic buffer that is used for diagnostic request reception for the protocol.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRxBufferRef配置项用于指定诊断通信层（DcmDsl）中用于接收数据的缓冲区引用，确保诊断请求能够被正确接收并存储。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的缓冲区大小足以容纳预期的最大诊断请求消息；缓冲区应当独立于其他通信对象以避免数据冲突；在多协议配置中，每个协议可能需要独立的接收缓冲区。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00701</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsl/DcmDslBuffer</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:ac8853c4-7b67-49a2-9902-4e319cf42ae2">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolSIDTable</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a service table that is used for diagnostic request processing for this protocol.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolSIDTable配置项用于定义诊断会话层中支持的服务标识符（Service Identifier，SID）及其关联的处理函数，确保诊断请求能够被正确解析和响应。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolSIDTable时，必须确保每个SID与其对应的处理函数正确映射，避免服务处理混淆；应考虑诊断会话控制和安全访问限制，以免在不适当的会话或安全级别下执行服务；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，还需确保配置项与诊断协议（如UDS，KWP2000等）的要求相符。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00702</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsd/DcmDsdServiceTable</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:805d3919-9dfb-4b43-9ae1-6960d5e38e48">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolTxBufferRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a configured diagnostic buffer that is used for diagnostic response transmission for the protocol.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolTxBufferRef配置项用于指定诊断会话层（Dsl）中，用于传输响应消息的缓冲区引用，确保诊断响应能够被正确地存储和发送。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：必须确保引用的TxBuffer足够大，以容纳可能的最大响应消息；在配置多个诊断协议时，应注意不同协议可能需要不同大小的TxBuffer；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中是必需的，缺失或错误配置可能导致诊断通信失败。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00704</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsl/DcmDslBuffer</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b4b72325-5ba3-4f11-a666-cb8899c92aec">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslConnection</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a communication channel for one particular protocol.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslConnection配置项定义了诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中客户端（通常是诊断工具）与服务器（车辆控制单元或ECU）之间的通信连接参数，包括连接的类型、通信协议和优先级等。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslConnection时，需确保通信协议与车辆支持的诊断协议一致；连接类型应根据实际的诊断需求和车辆网络架构选择；优先级设置需考虑到不同诊断任务之间的相对重要性，避免重要诊断任务被延迟或阻塞。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Note that it is allowed to communicate with multiple testers, therefore multiple connections may be configured for a protocol.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00705</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <CHOICES>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:787d42ea-80c4-421b-b78a-15d1815c5b9e">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslMainConnection</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration for a main connection of a diagnostic protocol. Additionally it may contain references to ROE and Periodic connections if the protocol type or protocol transmission type needs them.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslMainConnection配置项定义了诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中主连接的属性，这包括了与客户端（如诊断工具）的通信参数和连接引用。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslMainConnection时，需要确保它与所引用的DcmDslProtocolRow和DcmDslConnection配置一致；主连接应该唯一地关联到一个特定的诊断协议；在配置多个连接时，要注意它们之间的优先级和冲突管理。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00706</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <PARAMETERS>
                                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c60c78d9-5dd3-4839-9dda-c7d70f78692a">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRxConnectionId</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Unique identifier of the tester which uses this connection for diagnostic communication.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRxConnectionId 是用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，诊断协议层与网络层之间的接收连接标识符，确保正确的数据传输和接收。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个DcmDslProtocolRxConnectionId是唯一的，以避免数据接收时的冲突；该标识符通常与具体的通信通道和网络协议栈配置相关联；在配置多个诊断协议时，应注意不同协议间的连接标识符不要重复。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00826</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:bde92d30-04fb-4f22-b6a6-2bc9b1c7ea58">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRxTesterSourceAddr</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Tester source address uniquely describes a client and will be used e.g within the jump to Bootloader interfaces. This parameter is not required for generic connections (DcmPdus with MetaDataLength &gt;= 1).</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRxTesterSourceAddr配置项定义了用于车辆诊断通信中，接收端（通常是车辆的诊断控制模块）所期望的测试仪器的源地址。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保地址符合网络中实际测试设备的地址；不同的诊断协议可能需要不同的源地址配置；源地址配置错误可能导致诊断通信失败。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01115</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                      </PARAMETERS>
                                      <REFERENCES>
                                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:36862e98-cc62-4b93-ae20-4a878da1fdc1">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslPeriodicTransmissionConRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a periodic transmission connection which is used for the processing of periodic transmission events.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslPeriodicTransmissionConRef配置项用于引用Dcm中用于周期性传输的连接，它指定了哪些网络连接可以用于周期性数据的传输。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置周期性传输时，确保引用的网络连接支持所需的传输协议和带宽；周期性传输可能对网络带宽和ECU处理能力有较高要求，需谨慎配置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中对于周期性传输的支持和配置可能有特定限制或要求，需要参考具体的AUTOSAR文档。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                                            <SDGS>
                                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                              </SDG>
                                            </SDGS>
                                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00707</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsl/DcmDslProtocol/DcmDslProtocolRow/DcmDslConnection/DcmDslPeriodicTransmission</DESTINATION-REF>
                                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:855610d2-6cfe-4554-af1b-1642fe0b6c4d">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolComMChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the ComMChannel on which the DcmDslProtocolRxPdu is received and the DcmDslProtocolTxPdu is transmitted.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolComMChannelRef配置项用于指定诊断通信管理（Diagnostic Communication Manager）层中，每个诊断协议所使用的通信通道引用。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个诊断协议正确引用了对应的ComM通道，以保证诊断消息能够通过正确的网络通道传输；在配置时需注意与网络管理配置的一致性，避免配置错误导致通信失败；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中是必需的，缺失可能导致诊断功能不完整或不可用。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00952</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5b5ab87b-d1d2-49a0-8614-0a8cbce297d8">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslROEConnectionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a ResponseOnEvent connection which is used for the processing of ResponseOnEvent events.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslROEConnectionRef配置项用于定义诊断通信管理（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，响应式事件（Response On Event, ROE）与网络连接之间的关联。这使得系统能够在特定网络连接上根据事件触发诊断响应。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslROEConnectionRef时，必须确保引用的网络连接已经定义且有效；此配置项对于实现基于事件的诊断通信至关重要，因此需要仔细配置以避免通信问题；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于ROE的支持和配置要求可能与早期版本有所不同，需要注意版本间的兼容性。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                                            <SDGS>
                                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                              </SDG>
                                            </SDGS>
                                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00708</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsl/DcmDslProtocol/DcmDslProtocolRow/DcmDslConnection/DcmDslResponseOnEvent</DESTINATION-REF>
                                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                      </REFERENCES>
                                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a20beee4-a6e4-47cf-a95d-e302e3152954">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRx</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters of a reception channel in a diagnostic connection.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRx配置项用于定义诊断通信层中接收通道的属性，包括接收数据的协议、PDU ID、以及与之相关的资源和参数。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolRx时，需要确保PDU ID与ECU中实际的PDU配置相匹配；此外，应当注意与DcmDslProtocolTx配置项的一致性，以保证诊断通信的双向性；最后，该配置项的属性应符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对诊断通信层的规定。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <INTRODUCTION>
                                            <P>
                                              <L-1 L="EN">The PDU referenced by this reception channel can consume meta data items of type SOURCE_ADDRESS_16 and TARGET_ADDRESS_16.</L-1>
                                            </P>
                                          </INTRODUCTION>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00709</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                          <PARAMETERS>
                                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3153c26e-8c9d-4a5c-8e1f-f057f190b662">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRxAddrType</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Selects the addressing type of the reception channel. Physical addressing is used for 1:1 communication, functional addressing is used for 1:N communication.</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRxAddrType配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，不同诊断协议下的接收地址类型，如物理地址或功能地址。</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolRxAddrType时，需要确保地址类型与诊断协议的要求相匹配；此配置项对于确保正确的诊断请求路由至适当的服务组件至关重要；在多协议环境中，应注意不同协议间的地址类型可能会有所不同，需要分别配置。</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                                <P>
                                                  <L-1 L="EN">For details refer to ISO 14229-1.</L-1>
                                                </P>
                                              </INTRODUCTION>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00710</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                              <LITERALS>
                                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2125efd6-c909-8c1d-64c9-11a7e4227982">
                                                  <SHORT-NAME>DCM_FUNCTIONAL_TYPE</SHORT-NAME>
                                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2248ec43-6f95-928e-4a9b-bb123fe10582">
                                                  <SHORT-NAME>DCM_PHYSICAL_TYPE</SHORT-NAME>
                                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                              </LITERALS>
                                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:10a56ade-4325-452b-9894-3831fffdfe3e">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRxPduId</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Identifier of the PDU that is used for this reception channel.</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRxPduId配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，接收协议数据单元（Protocol Data Unit）的标识符，它关联了网络层的接收PDU与Dcm的特定协议。</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolRxPduId时，必须确保PDU ID与ECU中定义的PDU相匹配，并且在整个系统中是唯一的；此外，PDU ID应与正确的Dcm协议层配置相对应，以确保诊断消息能够被正确处理；在配置时还应注意PDU的传输方向，确保是接收方向的PDU ID。</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                                <SDGS>
                                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                                  </SDG>
                                                </SDGS>
                                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00687</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                          </PARAMETERS>
                                          <REFERENCES>
                                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:1feb227f-e987-4c86-9384-46a3c2a010e0">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRxPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Pdu in EcuC that is used for this reception channel.</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolRxPduRef配置项用于指定诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，诊断会话层（Diagnostic Session Layer）所使用的接收PDU（Protocol Data Unit）的引用。</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的PDU与所需的诊断协议匹配；PDU配置必须在PduR模块中正确定义；在配置多个协议时，注意PDU的唯一性和冲突避免。</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00770</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                          </REFERENCES>
                                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b958f8ce-3646-41ea-8ce3-49ab965deb4e">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolTx</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters of a transmission channel in a diagnostic connection.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolTx配置项定义了诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的传输协议层，用于管理与车辆控制单元（ECU）之间的数据传输。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslProtocolTx时，必须确保其与车辆的ECU支持的协议一致；配置错误可能导致诊断通信失败；此配置项应与DcmDslProtocolRx相匹配，以确保数据的双向正确传输。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <INTRODUCTION>
                                            <P>
                                              <L-1 L="EN">The PDU referenced by this transmission channel can produce meta data items of type TARGET_ADDRESS_16 and SOURCE_ADDRESS_16.</L-1>
                                            </P>
                                          </INTRODUCTION>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00711</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <PARAMETERS>
                                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1e47d6e3-4563-4144-875c-5be2e99fed12">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslTxConfirmationPduId</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Identifier of the PDU that is used by the lower level module for transmission confirmation of responses on this channel.</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslTxConfirmationPduId用于标识诊断通信管理（Diagnostic Communication Manager）模块中，发送确认消息时所使用的协议数据单元（PDU）ID。</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项必须与实际使用的PDU ID一致，以确保正确的消息确认；在配置时需注意与其他模块的PDU ID避免冲突；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保PDU ID的配置符合ECU的通信需求和规范。</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                                <SDGS>
                                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                                  </SDG>
                                                </SDGS>
                                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00864</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                          </PARAMETERS>
                                          <REFERENCES>
                                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:d7017621-c9f2-4141-839e-01f377de2571">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolTxPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Pdu in EcuC that is used for this transmission channel.</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslProtocolTxPduRef配置项用于指定诊断会话层（DcmDsl）中，用于传输（发送）诊断消息的PDU（协议数据单元）引用。</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的PDU与所需的诊断协议兼容；在配置多个协议时，注意避免PDU引用冲突；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，该配置项的属性应与PDU属性匹配，若有不一致，需检查PDU配置。</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00772</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                          </REFERENCES>
                                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f97406b7-1fec-4962-9005-e370f9c77597">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslPeriodicTransmission</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a periodic transmission connection.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslPeriodicTransmission配置项用于定义诊断通信层中，周期性数据传输的参数和行为，这包括周期性响应的发送间隔和优先级等设置。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保周期性传输的配置不会与其他网络通信活动发生冲突；合理设置周期性传输的时间间隔，以避免对网络的过度占用；考虑到不同ECU的处理能力和网络带宽，应当在系统级别上协调周期性传输的配置。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                        <SDGS>
                                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                          </SDG>
                                        </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00741</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:9588fe5b-7c1b-4e2f-a19f-21154bbbcc1c">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslPeriodicConnection</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a transmission channel for a periodic transmission connection.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslPeriodicConnection配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，周期性数据传输的连接参数，包括周期性消息的发送间隔和优先级。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置周期性连接时，需确保发送间隔和优先级符合网络带宽和系统处理能力；配置的值应与ECU的实际能力和网络管理策略相匹配；在多ECU系统中，还需考虑不同ECU间的周期性消息协调。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <INTRODUCTION>
                                            <P>
                                              <L-1 L="EN">The PDU referenced by this transmission channel can produce meta data items of type TARGET_ADDRESS_16 and SOURCE_ADDRESS_16.</L-1>
                                            </P>
                                          </INTRODUCTION>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00897</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                          <PARAMETERS>
                                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6c28bf5b-2fa4-407e-b896-a6234a8de3a1">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslPeriodicTxConfirmationPduId</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Identifier of the PDU that is used by the lower level module for transmission confirmation of responses on this channel.</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslPeriodicTxConfirmationPduId配置项用于定义诊断通信层（DcmDsl）中，周期性传输确认的PDU标识符，这是用于确认周期性响应消息已经被成功发送的。</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslPeriodicTxConfirmationPduId时，需要确保PDU ID与ECU中定义的PDU ID一致；此ID应与实际用于周期性消息传输的PDU ID相匹配；在配置时应注意不要与其他PDU ID冲突，以避免通信错误。</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00862</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                          </PARAMETERS>
                                          <REFERENCES>
                                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:c605a94a-8f46-47f4-a660-d875d0166f23">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslPeriodicTxPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Pdu in EcuC that is used for this periodic transmission channel.</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslPeriodicTxPduRef配置项用于引用由诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）定期发送的PDU（协议数据单元）。</L-2>
                                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslPeriodicTxPduRef时，需要确保引用的PDU符合诊断协议要求，并且已经在PDU路由表中正确定义；此外，该PDU应当配置为可定期发送，以支持Dcm的定期数据传输需求；在配置过程中，还需注意PDU的传输属性，如周期时间和带宽管理，以确保系统资源的有效利用和通信的可靠性。</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00742</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                          </REFERENCES>
                                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:0bbe05fb-6089-4982-b32f-459105678cfe">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslResponseOnEvent</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a ResponseOnEvent connection.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslResponseOnEvent配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）在特定事件发生时如何响应，例如在接收到特定的诊断请求或者内部事件时。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslResponseOnEvent时，需要确保事件触发条件与响应动作之间的映射关系符合系统的诊断需求；此配置项应与其他诊断服务配置协同工作，避免配置冲突；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能对事件类型、响应行为和优先级等属性有具体的规定，需要遵守这些规定以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                        <SDGS>
                                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                          </SDG>
                                        </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The PDU referenced by this transmission channel can produce meta data items of type TARGET_ADDRESS_16 and SOURCE_ADDRESS_16.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00744</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <PARAMETERS>
                                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:85552057-605f-4b71-a249-eba0aa7e95b8">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslRoeTxConfirmationPduId</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Identifier of the PDU that is used by the lower level module for transmission confirmation of responses on this connection.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDslRoeTxConfirmationPduId配置项用于定义诊断通信层中，用于发送响应事件报告（Response On Event, ROE）的确认消息的PDU（协议数据单元）标识符。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDslRoeTxConfirmationPduId时，需要确保所指定的PDU ID与系统中定义的PDU ID一致，并且与其他服务或功能使用的PDU ID不冲突；此配置项通常与Dcm配置中的网络层PDU ID相关联，需要根据网络管理策略和PDU路由信息进行正确配置；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的使用符合诊断服务的规范要求，以保证ROE服务的正确实现和响应。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00863</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
