                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fdeee75f-15a9-40fa-858b-2dc6713a7e05">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspEnableSessionChangeCallback</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enable callback to be called on diagnostic session state change.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspEnableSessionChangeCallback配置项用于定义诊断会话控制服务（Diagnostic Session Control service）在会话变更时是否调用特定的回调函数，以执行用户定义的操作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保回调函数的实现与预期行为一致；此配置项对于实现会话管理逻辑特别重要；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的使用与系统需求相匹配，避免不必要的资源消耗。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Enable callback to be called on diagnostic session state change.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_10201</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fdeee76f-17a9-40fa-858b-2dc6713a7e05">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspEnableEcuResetCallback</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enable callback to be called on ecu reset change.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspEnableEcuResetCallback配置项用于定义在执行ECU重置服务（如UDS服务0x11）之前，是否需要调用一个特定的回调函数，以便执行一些特定的预处理操作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保回调函数的实现不会导致重置流程���的任何延迟或阻塞；如果不需要特定的预处理操作，可以不配置此项或将其设置为NULL；回调函数的设计应遵循AUTOSAR的编码规范，确保安全和效率。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Enable callback to be called on ecu reset change.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_10203</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
