                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c90e5cc9-5e82-4f9c-ac3c-0a8d1b039430">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMaxPeriodicDidToRead</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Indicates the maximum allowed periodicDIDs which can be read in a single &quot;ReadDataByPeriodicIdentifier&quot; request.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMaxPeriodicDidToRead配置项用于指定诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）在周期性数据标识符读取列表中能够管理的最大数据标识符数量。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值应根据实际应用需求和系统资源合理配置；超出此数量的周期性数据标识符请求可能会被拒绝；在配置时需考虑ECU的内存和处理能力限制。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00956</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
