                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/KeyM/KeyMCertificate/KeyMCertificateElement</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ca640cda-058c-46de-84b9-ba4a1b996be8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspClearDTC</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration for the Clear DTC service.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspClearDTC是一个配置参数，用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的DTC（Diagnostic Trouble Code）清除服务的行为和属性，包括清除DTC的范围和条件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspClearDTC时，需要确保它符合车辆制造商的诊断策略和法规要求；此外，应注意与其他诊断服务的交互，以及在不同诊断会话控制下的DTC清除权限。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01064</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:10fe8092-152e-4b13-8e76-884aa4dd1b2a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspClearDTCCheckFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Callback function for condition check, manufacturer / supplier specific checks on the groupOfDTC, which is requested to clear.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspClearDTCCheckFnc配置项用于定义一个函数，该函数在执行故障码清除（Clear Diagnostic Trouble Codes, DTCs）操作之前被调用，以检查是否满足清除DTC的条件。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspClearDTCCheckFnc时，需要确保所引用的函数符合AUTOSAR标准中对该函数的定义和要求；该函数的实现应当仅检查清除DTC的条件，而不执行其他诊断服务或副作用；在设计该函数时，应考虑到车辆状态和安全要求，确保在适当的条件下才允许清除DTC。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">This parameter is related to the interface : Xxx_ClearDTCCheckFnc.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01066</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                              </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:77018007-1b7f-4357-80f5-ad5582965718">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspClearDTCModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmModeRule</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspClearDTCModeRuleRef配置项用于定义诊断服务中清除故障码（DTC）操作的模式规则引用，指定在何种条件下允许执行清除DTC的操作。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的模式规则与实际的诊断需求相匹配，避免因规则设置不当导致清除DTC操作无法按预期执行；在配置时需考虑车辆的安全和诊断策略，确保不会误清除关键故障码；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于DcmDspClearDTCModeRuleRef的具体实现细节和限制可能有更新，建议参考最新的AUTOSAR文档。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Mode rule which controls to clear the DTCs. If there is no reference, no check of the mode rule shall be done.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01065</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmProcessingConditions/DcmModeRule</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:0c9e3894-cb67-40b2-85ec-e98eaa82ce22">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControl</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Provides the configuration of the CommunicationControl mechanism.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControl配置项是用于定义诊断通信控制服务（Diagnostic Communication Manager Service）的参数，它允许控制ECU（电子控制单元）的通信能力，例如开启或关闭ECU的网络通信。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspComControl时，需要确保与ECU支持的诊断服务和安全级别相匹配；此外，应考虑与其他诊断服务的交互和对车辆网络的影响；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能对该服务的实现和配置有具体的要求和限制，需要遵循这些规范来确保兼容性和正确性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00900</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:65450923-f2d8-466d-9545-687f4c3c9ce3">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlAllChannel</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Collection of ComM channels which shall be controlled if all networks are addressed.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlAllChannel 是一个配置项，用于定义诊断通信管理（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中是否允许对所有通信通道执行通信控制。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保Dcm模块配置与通信堆栈的其他部分兼容；如果不需要对所有通道执行通信控制，应避免启用此配置以节省资源；此配置项的使用应符合车辆制造商的诊断策略和安全要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00901</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:bebad64c-ad61-4059-958b-7c7a47006690">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlAllChannelUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Allow to activate or deactivate the usage of a ComM channel collection to be controlled, for multi purpose ECUs</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlAllChannelUsed配置项用于指定在执行通信控制服务时，是否允许控制所有通信通道。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项确保了诊断通信控制服务（Service 0x28）能够按需控制单个或所有通信通道；若设置为允许，需确保系统设计能够安全地处理对所有通道的控制；不正确的配置可能导致通信中断或系统行为不稳定。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">true = ComM channel collection used
                                                                false = ComM channel collection not used</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01045</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5912f62f-df55-4be2-9c52-e16cbc0b35af">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspAllComMChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to ComM channel.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspAllComMChannelRef配置项用于引用诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中所有通信通道的标识符，这些通道在执行诊断会话控制时需要被管理。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspAllComMChannelRef时，需要确保引用的ComM通道标识符与实际的通信通道配置相匹配；此配置项对于确保在不同诊断会话中正确管理通信通道至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的模块间接口定义和引用机制。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00902</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:dcd07ce7-0e48-4e1f-9c40-a67735694989">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlSetting</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Provide the configuration of the Communication control.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlSetting 用于定义诊断通信控制模块的设置，包括启用或禁用网络通信控制功能。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspComControlSetting时，必须确保与车辆的网络管理策略一致；此配置项应根据具体的车辆网络需求和诊断需求进行调整；不正确的设置可能导致网络通信异常或诊断功能不可用。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00943</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8a627083-6c30-4af3-a8b6-a78d4dd06ab0">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlCommunicationReEnableModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmModeRule Mode rule which controls re-enabling</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlCommunicationReEnableModeRuleRef配置项用于引用一个定义了通信控制器重新启用模式的规则，这个规则指定了在执行诊断通信控制时，通信通道如何被重新启用。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的模式规则与实际的通信控制需求相匹配；在配置时要注意引用的模式规则必须已在系统中定义；在多通道通信系统中，要确保每个通道的重新启用规则正确配置，以避免通信混乱。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">of communication by DCM. [ref. SWS_Dcm_00753]</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00944</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmProcessingConditions/DcmModeRule</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:374e181d-e674-4ad6-bb50-aed37d372b37">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlSpecificChannel</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Assigns subnet number to ComM channel which will be controlled.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlSpecificChannel配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Dcm）中，通信控制服务（Communication Control, 0x28）针对特定通信通道的控制属性和行为。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保通道标识符与实际系统中的通信通道相匹配；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中要求明确支持网络管理控制器的能力，如果系统不支持，应在设计时予以考虑；配置应遵循ECU支持的通信协议和标准，确保兼容性和协议一致性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00903</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0158d8b7-622a-48cd-b045-be5c34990787">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlSpecificChannelUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Allow to activate or deactivate the usage of a Subnet assigned to the ComM channel which will be controlled, for multi purpose ECUs.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlSpecificChannelUsed配置项用于指定诊断服务是否允许对特定的通信通道进行控制，这有助于在执行诊断会话时，根据需要启用或禁用特定的通信路径。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保在使用此配置项时，已经明确了哪些通信通道可以被控制，以避免对系统通信造成意外的干扰；此配置项的使用应与车辆制造商的安全和诊断策略保持一致；在配置时，应详细考虑对通信通道控制的影响，确保不会影响到系统的正常运行和安全。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">true = Subnet used
                                                                false = Subnet not used</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01046</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ed492ab2-a4e0-41b7-ae06-1f153246af19">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSubnetNumber</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Subnet Number which controls the specific ComMChannel.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSubnetNumber配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中子网的数量，这有助于管理不同网络子集上的诊断通信。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspSubnetNumber时，需要确保其值反映了实际网络拓扑中存在的子网数量；超出实际子网数量的配置可能会导致资源浪费；如果配置的子网数量少于实际存在的子网，可能会导致部分子网上的诊断请求无法得到处理。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00905</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>14</MAX>
                                  <MIN>1</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5558bfb9-fa84-4b06-ab57-e2f7dca19a2a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSpecificComMChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to ComM channel.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSpecificComMChannelRef配置项用于指定诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中特定的通信通道引用，以便于Dcm模块控制特定通道的通信状态。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspSpecificComMChannelRef时，需要确保引用的ComM通道已经在系统中定义并且有效；此配置项通常与车辆网络相关的诊断功能紧密相关，因此需要根据网络架构和诊断需求谨慎配置；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的模块间接口定义和配置规则，以确保模块间的兼容性和通信的正确性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00904</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:14ca4bab-8ff3-4576-a85a-86cf051ee586">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlSubNode</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container gives information about the node identification number and the ComM channel used to address a sub-network.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlSubNode配置项用于定义诊断通信控制服务（Diagnostic Communication Manager Service）中子节点的通信控制选项，它指定了哪些网络节点（ECUs）的通信可以被控制。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspComControlSubNode时，需要确保子节点的标识符与实际网络中的ECU标识符相匹配；此配置项通常与车辆网络拓扑结构和诊断需求紧密相关，因此需要根据具体的车辆网络设计来进行配置；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的诊断服务规范来确保通信控制的正确实施。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01033</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0e8ee8c6-840a-4291-89c7-8d3354eb5756">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlSubNodeUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter determines if a node control function is available or not.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlSubNodeUsed 是一个配置项，用于指定是否在诊断通信控制（Dcm）服务中使用子节点控制。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果项目需要支持对网络中的子节点（如网关下的各个ECU）进行通信控制，则应启用此配置项；如果不需要子节点控制功能，该配置项应设置为不启用以节省资源；在配置时需要确保与项目需求和网络架构相匹配。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0ca50ea4-b3da-4b6d-9fa4-043d1950b46c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlSubNodeId</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">The node identification number DcmDspComControlSubNodeId is addressed by the CommunicationControl (0x28) request.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlSubNodeId配置项用于定义诊断通信控制服务（Diagnostic Communication Manager Service Processor）中子网络的标识符，这有助于管理不同子网络上的通信控制。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspComControlSubNodeId时，需要确保子网络标识符的唯一性，以避免在诊断会话中的冲突；此外，标识符应与实际网络结构相对应，确保正确的通信控制；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果子网络的概念被用于项目中，该配置项应当与网络管理配置紧密协调。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01031</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                  <MIN>1</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:03dd354b-0dc4-46fb-beb2-f249375d343b">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspComControlSubNodeComMChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references a ComM channel where this node is connected to.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspComControlSubNodeComMChannelRef配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Dcm）中，特定子节点与通信管理（ComM）通道的关联，以便控制网络通信状态。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的ComM通道与子节点兼容；在配置时需注意AUTOSAR版本对ComM通道引用的具体要求可能有所不同；此配置项对于实现网络管理和诊断通信控制功能至关重要。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01030</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ca8a10df-d4f9-4e52-a156-1cd82415ec12">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspCommonAuthorization</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for the common Authorization being equal for several  services / sub-services.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspCommonAuthorization配置项用于定义诊断服务的授权级别，它规定了访问不同诊断服务时所需的安全级别，以确保只有授权用户可以执行特定的诊断操作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspCommonAuthorization时，需要确保授权级别与实际的安全需求相匹配；此外，应注意与Dcm的安全策略和密钥管理机制的兼容性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循相关的模块和服务的安全规范。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01025</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:4f210f3b-5864-4a5a-805d-566621d558fb">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspCommonAuthorizationModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmModeRule</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspCommonAuthorizationModeRuleRef配置项用于引用一个授权模式规则，该规则定义了对诊断服务请求的访问权限控制，以确保只有授权的用户可以访问特定的诊断服务。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的授权模式规则已经定义且有效；授权模式规则的配置应与系统的安全需求相匹配，以防未授权访问；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，对授权模式的支持和实现细节可能有所不同，需要参考具体的AUTOSAR文档。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Mode rule which controls this service/ sub-service. If there is no reference, no check of the mode rule shall be done.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01028</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmProcessingConditions/DcmModeRule</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:b3cf076c-cd37-4da1-b8d0-d22313e702a3">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspCommonAuthorizationSecurityLevelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmDspSecurityRow</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspCommonAuthorizationSecurityLevelRef配置项用于引用在诊断服务处理期间需要的安全等级，它定义了访问特定诊断服务时所需的安全授权级别。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的安全等级与实际实现的安全策略相匹配；若引用了不存在的安全等级，可能导致诊断服务无法正确执行；在多安全等级的系统中，正确管理和配置每个服务的安全等级至关重要。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Security levels allowed to control this service/ sub-service. If there is no reference, no check of security level shall be done.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01026</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
