                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f52ecd11-ea14-4748-9443-0abd77616c88">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspControlDTCSetting</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Provide the configuration of the ControlDTCSetting mechanism.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspControlDTCSetting配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，控制诊断故障码（DTC）设置的行为和属性，如启用或禁用DTC的存储。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意事项：在配置DcmDspControlDTCSetting时，需确保与车辆制造商的诊断策略一致；此配置项对故障诊断和后续的故障处理流程有重要影响；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对DTC控制的具体实现细节有明确规范，需遵守这些规范以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00935</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:064c47c9-6120-4f37-9a14-241293307c36">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmSupportDTCSettingControlOptionRecord</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines if the DTCSettingControlOptionRecord is in general supported in the request message or not.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSupportDTCSettingControlOptionRecord配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）是否支持故障码设置控制选项记录功能，这是一个用于控制故障诊断记录开启或关闭的功能。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置Dcm模块时，需要根据项目需求决定是否启用此功能；如果启用，需确保与故障管理模块的交互被正确实现；在不同地区的法规要求可能不同，需要根据目标市场的法规要求来配置此项。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00965</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:445fcc69-e94a-4073-a171-83af0d10d7ea">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspControlDTCSettingReEnableModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmModeRule</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspControlDTCSettingReEnableModeRuleRef配置项用于引用诊断服务组件中控制DTC设置的重新启用模式规则，这决定了在何种条件下可以重新启用DTC记录。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的模式规则与实际的诊断需求和法规要求相匹配；在配置时应参照相关的诊断需求文档；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应保证该引用的模式规则在系统中是存在且有效的。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Mode rule which controls re-enabling of controlDTCsetting by DCM. The DCM module shall execute a ControlDTCSetting.Off  (call Dem_EnableDTCSetting()) in case that the referenced mode rule is not fulfilled anymore.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00936</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
