                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-ADD-INFO-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b6ff617d-bf44-4d08-ad26-739655a55656">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDataConditionCheckReadFncUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter determines if a condition check function is available or not.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDataConditionCheckReadFncUsed 是一个配置项，用于指定是否使用了数据条件检查读取功能，这是诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）的一部分，用于在读取数据之前检查是否满足特定条件。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项应当与实际实现的功能相匹配；如果未实现数据条件检查功能，则该配置项应设置为false；如果实现了该功能，确保相关函数的正确实现和配置。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00955</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
