                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:a8a92cee-8382-4335-8ca4-6c8b62dcbded">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDataWriteFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Function name to request application to write the data value of a DID. (WriteData-function).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDataWriteFnc配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，用于写入数据到ECU的函数指针。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该函数指针指向的函数遵循了标准的API原型；该函数通常与DcmDspData元素相关联，需要确保数据一致性和安全性；在实现时，应考虑对写入操作的权限管理和错误处理。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">This parameter is related to the interface Xxx_WriteData.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00670</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
