                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f901f114-8382-430a-89dc-df15aeeb8054">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDataInfoRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to 1 DcmDspDataInfo</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDataInfoRef配置项用于引用数据元素的特定信息，这些信息定义了数据元素如何被诊断服务处理，包括读取和写入权限、安全访问级别等。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的数据信息与实际的诊断需求相匹配，避免权限不足或过高；在配置时需注意数据信息的兼容性，确保其符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准；对于安全敏感的数据元素，应仔细配置安全访问级别，以防未授权访问。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00811</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspDataInfo</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:38d0bb55-7999-8e1d-251f-629a09bc365f">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDiagnosisScaling</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of an alternative Diagnosis Representation. Out if this the scaling between Diagnosis and ECU internal representation and vice versa can be calculated.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00993</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <CHOICES>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4fe13153-3eda-d245-cb8f-79224bee1909">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspAlternativeDataInterface</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of an alternative Diagnosis Representation by the means of a VariableDataPrototoype in a DataInterface.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Additionally a reference to PortInterfaceMapping can be defined which provide already the mapping rules between the VariableDataPrototoype in a DataInterface used by the software component (DcmDspExternalSRDataElementClass) and the intended Diagnosis Representation defined by DcmDataElement.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00994</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:681dac2b-c4a3-1a18-76ac-a0cfb533722b">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDataElement</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Alternative Diagnosis Representation for the data defined by the means of a VariableDataPrototoype in a DataInterface.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The CompuMethod of the data type of the referenced VariableDataPrototype will be applied to the data type of the VariableDataPrototype in the interface used by the Dcm.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00995</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:7705b206-ed9a-124a-51ca-c87c710371d5">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmPortInterfaceMapping</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Optional reference to PortInterfaceMapping which defines the mapping rules.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The PortInterfaceMapping is used to get the DataPrototypeMapping that describes a conversion between the data prototype referenced by DcmDataElement and the data prototype referenced from DcmDspExternalSRDataElementClass.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00996</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>PORT-INTERFACE-MAPPING</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:20529633-341f-d12d-c95a-7f3d223b6acf">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspAlternativeDataType</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of an alternative Diagnosis Representation by the means of an ApplicationDataType.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Additionally the definition of a text table mapping can be a defined for ApplicationDataTypes with a CompuMethod of category TEXTTABLE and SCALE_LINEAR_AND_TEXTTABLE.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00997</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:985e0ccd-d6ed-1fc9-8678-6f9105a8da8d">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmApplicationDataType</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Alternative Diagnosis Representation for the data defined by the means of a ApplicationDataType of category VALUE, BOOLEAN or ARRAY.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The CompuMethod that applies to the referenced ApplicationDataType in case of category VALUE or BOOLEAN will be applied to the data type of the VariableDataPrototype in the interface used by the Dcm.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00998</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>APPLICATION-DATA-TYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e206a467-f06c-16a5-705a-b698b9498c0a">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspTextTableMapping</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">The purpose of the DcmDspTextTableMapping is to associate a texttable value defined in the context of the Dcm to a texttable value defined in the context of a CompuMethod referenced by a DataType that shall be taken to create a dataElement in a SenderReceiverInterface. By this means it is possible to create a primitive version of a TexttableMapping (which can only be applied if a dataElement already exists).</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">In other words, the DcmDspTextTableMapping provides a similar mechanism to the TexttableMapping in a situation where the TexttableMapping cannot be applied since the SenderReceiverInterface for the PortPrototype on the Dcm ServiceComponent does not yet exist.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00999</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                      <PARAMETERS>
                                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:69949394-c075-5927-f156-a7b311e2648d">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDiagnosisRepresentationDataValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">The data value in the diagnosis representation.</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01001</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6eba6ad0-0983-5be3-1cdd-c2c67fd4b7e6">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspInternalDataValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">The ECU internal data value.</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01000</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                      </PARAMETERS>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:335a857a-a81a-cf3f-d490-231a808f83ca">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspAlternativeDiagnosticDataElement</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of an alternative Diagnosis Representation by the means of Diagnostic Extract.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01084</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:1dc828cf-3348-1d3c-8730-beb9b1afd19e">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDiagnosticDataElementRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Alternative Diagnosis Representation for the data defined by the means of a DiagnosticDataElement in the Diagnostic Extract.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">This EcucForeignReference enables the access to all SwDataDefProps, in particular BaseType, CompuMethod and DataConstr

                                                                        The CompuMethod and DataConstr that applies to the referenced DiagnosticDataElement will be applied to the data type of the VariableDataPrototype in the interface used by the Dcm.
                                                                        The mapped ImplementationDataType needs to match the given BaseType.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01085</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>DIAGNOSTIC-DATA-ELEMENT</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </CHOICES>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4e6bffd4-147c-40f0-8f09-f31265103b92">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspExternalSRDataElementClass</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the source of data in a provided port which shall be read respectively the target of data in a required port which shall be written.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspExternalSRDataElementClass配置项用于定义诊断服务处理过程中，外部信号或数据元素的属性和行为，如数据大小、地址、读写权限等。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保数据元素的属性与实际应用中的数据类型和访问权限相匹配；对于敏感或安全相关的数据，应特别注意访问权限的设置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于数据元素的定义和使用有明确规范，需要遵循这些规范以保证诊断服务的正确实现。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">This container shall contain either one
                                                        DcmSubElementInDataElementInstance
                                                        OR
                                                        DcmDataElementInstance
                                                        OR
                                                        DcmSubElementInImplDataElementInstance
                                                        reference.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00989</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <CHOICES>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f74d3dfd-fa56-8a71-4417-c205b4bb79cf">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDataElementInstance</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Instance Reference to the primitive data in a port  where the data element is typed with an ApplicationPrimitveDataType or an ImplementationDataType.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01010</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-INSTANCE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:3c44b82a-cdcf-d321-d6d3-46e41e8aff43">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDataElementInstanceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Instance Reference to the primitive or array data which shall be read or written.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Supported are VariableDataPrototypes in SenderReceiverInterfaces and NvDataInterfaces and ParameterDataPrototypes in ParameterInterfaces (read only).
                                                                        This reference is applicable if the AutosarDataPrototype is typed with a ApplicationPrimitiveDataType of category VALUE or BOOLEAN or ApplicationArrayDataType or if the AutosarDataPrototype is typed with a ImplementationDataType of
                                                                        category VALUE, ARRAY or TYPE_REFERENCE that in turn boils down to VALUE or ARRAY</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00991</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-CONTEXT>ROOT-SW-COMPOSITION-PROTOTYPE SW-COMPONENT-PROTOTYPE PORT-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-CONTEXT>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>AUTOSAR-DATA-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-INSTANCE-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4d6a510b-073a-8d83-18f6-1601847108cd">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmSubElementInDataElementInstance</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Instance Reference to the primitve sub-element (at any level) of composite data in a port where the data element is typed with an ApplicationCompositeDataType.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01009</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-INSTANCE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:92cb4f89-788c-dac7-d44a-9ebaae808c40">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmSubElementInDataElementInstanceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Instance Reference to the primitve sub-element (at any level) of composite data in a port which shall be read.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Supported are VariableDataPrototypes in SenderReceiverInterfaces and NvDataInterfaces and ParameterDataPrototypes in ParameterInterfaces (read only).
                                                                        This reference is applicable if the AutosarDataPrototype is typed with a ApplicationCompositeDataType.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00990</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-CONTEXT>ROOT-SW-COMPOSITION-PROTOTYPE SW-COMPONENT-PROTOTYPE PORT-PROTOTYPE AUTOSAR-DATA-PROTOTYPE APPLICATION-COMPOSITE-ELEMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE*</DESTINATION-CONTEXT>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>APPLICATION-COMPOSITE-ELEMENT-DATA-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-INSTANCE-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8bd309c2-b2cb-866a-4703-de5122c9128a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmSubElementInImplDataElementInstance</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Instance Reference to the primitve sub-element (at any level) of composite data in a port where the data element is typed with an ImplementationDataType.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01011</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-INSTANCE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:fe649d83-3ec2-d131-d5d2-22db990cb8e7">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmSubElementInImplDataElementInstanceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Instance Reference to the primitve sub-element (at any level) of composite data in a port which shall be read.</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Supported are VariableDataPrototypes in SenderReceiverInterfaces and NvDataInterfaces and ParameterDataPrototypes in ParameterInterfaces (read only).
                                                                        This reference is applicable if the AutosarDataPrototype is typed with a ImplementationDataType of category STRUCTURE or ARRAY.
                                                                        Please note that in case of ARRAY the index attribute in the target reference has to be set to select a single array element.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00992</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-CONTEXT>ROOT-SW-COMPOSITION-PROTOTYPE SW-COMPONENT-PROTOTYPE PORT-PROTOTYPE AUTOSAR-DATA-PROTOTYPE IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE-ELEMENT*</DESTINATION-CONTEXT>
                                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>IMPLEMENTATION-DATA-TYPE-ELEMENT</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                    </ECUC-INSTANCE-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </CHOICES>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:540550cf-fb65-430b-b407-5cf94b6144d6">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidDataSupportInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the supported information.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidDataSupportInfo配置项用于定义诊断服务中数据标识符（DID）的支持信息，包括DID是否支持读取、写入、控制等操作。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidDataSupportInfo时，需要确保所指定的DID与实际支持的诊断服务相匹配；对于不支持的操作，应明确标记以避免诊断工具误操作；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对DID的操作权限有严格规定，需遵守相应的安全和权限要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01104</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:49397d89-a6d4-4891-8207-e271facf6807">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidDataSupportInfoBit</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Referenced Bit of the SupportInfo</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidDataSupportInfoBit配置项用于定义在诊断服务中，数据标识符（DID）的支持信息位，这通常用于指示某个DID是否支持读取、写入或控制操作。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidDataSupportInfoBit时，需要确保它与DID支持的操作相匹配；此配置项的设置必须符合ISO 14229标准中定义的服务响应格式；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，如果此配置项的属性与标准不一致，可能会导致诊断通信不正确或不兼容。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01097</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:d54f9fbd-eba6-450d-8778-967146e4a9b9">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidDataSupportInfoRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmDspDidSupportInfo</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidDataSupportInfoRef 用于引用支持特定数据标识符（DID）的数据支持信息，这有助于诊断通信管理中数据的读取和编码过程。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的数据支持信息与DID匹配正确，以保证诊断功能的正确执行；在配置时应参考具体的DID和其数据结构要求；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，此配置项的使用应严格遵循标准定义的数据封装和访问规则。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01098</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspDid/DcmDspDidSupportInfo</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a7c7d65b-f96c-481e-9915-b6a8f821b3f2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDataInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of one Data.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDataInfo 是用于定义诊断服务中数据元素的属性，如数据的安全访问级别和读写权限。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保配置的安全访问级别符合系统的安全需求；读写权限应明确，避免数据访问冲突；在配置时应考虑数据的敏感性和保护需求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00810</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:dbecb2eb-f520-4c7f-a440-9b11c678b939">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDataScalingInfoSize</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If Scaling information service is available for this Data, it provides the size in bytes of the scaling information.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDataScalingInfoSize配置项用于定义诊断服务中数据缩放信息的大小，这通常与数据参数的缩放比例有关，用于调整或转换数据值。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置数据缩放信息时，必须确保DcmDspDataScalingInfoSize的值与实际应用中使用的数据类型大小相匹配；此配置项的值应符合ECU支持的数据长度限制；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果数据缩放功能未被使用，该配置项可能不需要配置或者应设置为零。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00611</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:764c631a-1eb6-4103-9caf-2e3a153e8c0e">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDid</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of the DID.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDid 是用于定义诊断服务中数据标识符（DID）的配置，它指定了DID的属性、访问权限和与之关联的读写函数。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保DID的唯一性以避免在诊断会话中的冲突；合理配置访问权限以符合安全要求；在配置读写函数时，确保它们符合实际的硬件和应用需求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00601</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:aea67e5a-3529-4394-962d-d4273c9f8478">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Allow to activate or deactivate the usage of a DID, for multi  purpose ECUs</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidUsed配置项用于指定在诊断服务中使用的数据标识符（DID），它定义了哪些DID将被诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）识别和处理。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidUsed时，需要确保所引用的DID已在系统中定义，并且与诊断需求相匹配；DID的授权级别和安全访问条件也需要正确配置，以确保只有合适的诊断会话和安全级别才能访问这些DID；此外，DcmDspDidUsed配置应与车辆的诊断规范一致，避免配置不一致导致的诊断功能异常。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">true = DID available
                                                        false = DID not available</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00805</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9793eeb3-25a4-4b36-a8c4-6308743f8acf">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidUsePort</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Selects application interface type for DID data elements between a single operation for all data elements or data element specific operations.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidUsePort配置项用于指定诊断数据标识符（DID）是否使用端口接口来访问数据。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保DcmDspDidUsePort的设置与DID访问方式一致；如果使用端口接口，则需要定义相应的端口接口映射；不使用端口时，应使用内部或外部函数访问DID数据。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01122</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>USE_DATA_ELEMENT_SPECIFIC_INTERFACES</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:10c42b6d-a771-881e-5217-ed07d5be39a2">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>USE_DATA_ELEMENT_SPECIFIC_INTERFACES</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a1844866-0675-4b11-b499-64902eba2377">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">2 byte Identifier of the DID</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidIdentifier用于定义诊断数据标识符（DID）的属性，包括DID的标识符号、访问权限、以及与之关联的读写服务等。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidIdentifier时，确保DID符合ISO 14229标准中定义的范围；配置的访问权限需满足安全访问需求，避免未授权访问；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中对DID的处理能力和配置方式可能与早期版本有所不同，需注意兼容性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Within each DcmConfigSet all DcmDspDidIdentifier values shall be unique.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00602</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:69a67a52-6af2-4fea-8a88-3adf0ad143a6">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidSize</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Length of a DID in byte(s).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidSize配置项用于定义诊断数据标识符（DID）的大小，即DID所能承载的数据长度，这对于确保数据的正确读取和编码至关重要。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：DID大小需根据实际应用需求和标准协议要求谨慎设置；超出规定大小的DID可能导致诊断通信过程中的数据错误或丢失；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保DID大小与ECU支持的数据长度一致是必要的。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01099</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:1a5b29e9-1b7d-4abd-a1dc-88530091fe23">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidInfoRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmDspDidInfo containing information on this DID.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidInfoRef是一个配置项，用于引用与诊断数据标识符(DID)相关的信息，如DID的属性、服务和安全级别等，以支持诊断服务中对DID的处理。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidInfoRef时，确保引用的信息与DID的实际需求相匹配，以避免诊断服务中的错误处理；引用的信息应在系统中唯一定义，避免重复或冲突；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对DcmDspDidInfoRef的使用有明确规范，需要遵守相关规则以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00604</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspDidInfo</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:c952b37e-2c7f-4345-87ca-1d5ef787a73b">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmDspDid in case this DID refer to one or serveral other DID's</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidRef配置项用于定义诊断服务中数据标识符（DID）的引用，确保正确的数据访问和操作。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidRef时，必须确保引用的DID在系统中是存在且有效的；配置错误可能导致诊断通信失败；应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对DID管理和访问的具体规定。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00606</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspDid</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:0f35edfd-5cfd-46b2-b8c5-65edbb12aaca">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidSignal</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the reference to 1 DcmDspData container and position relevant for this DID.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidSignal配置项用于定义诊断数据标识符（DID）与信号之间的映射关系，确保在执行诊断服务时能够正确访问和操作特定的车辆信号。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidSignal时，需确保信号与DID之间的映射关系准确无误；对���每个DID，应详细定义信号的访问权限和安全级别；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中应遵循诊断通信管理模块的规范要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00813</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c6df96d8-2748-467c-ad5b-d6974983f1fc">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidByteOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Defines the absolute byte offset of the data defined by DcmDspDidDataRef reference to DcmDspData container in the DID.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidByteOffset配置项用于定义数据标识符（DID）在数据存储区中的字节偏移量，这决定了DID数据在内存中的具体位置。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidByteOffset时，需要确保偏移量正确反映了DID数据在内存中的实际位置；避免不同的DID之间存在重叠，这可能导致数据的读写冲突；在配置时还应考虑数据对齐要求，以确保有效的内存访问和符合架构的数据访问规则。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01105</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>65535</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:560b79b2-5b33-47b9-856d-e12d6b5cda9a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidDataRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to 1 DcmDspData container relevant for this DID.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidDataRef配置项用于定义诊断数据标识符（DID）与其相关数据元素的关联，这样在诊断通信中可以正确地访问和管理这些数据。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidDataRef时，必须确保引用的数据元素与DID兼容，并且满足诊断服务的数据格式和长度要求；此外，应当注意数据元素的访问权限设置，以确保只有授权的诊断会话和安全等级才能访问敏感数据；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果配置项的属性与标准不一致，可能会导致诊断服务无法正确执行或数据访问出现错误。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00808</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspData</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a812e690-cb7d-491b-abea-9d73c0d219f2">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidSupportInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the support information to declare the usability of the data bytes within the DIDs</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidSupportInfo配置项用于定义诊断服务中数据标识符（DID）的支持信息，包括DID是否支持读取、写入、控制等操作。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidSupportInfo时，需要确保每个DID的支持信息与实际功能需求相匹配；对于不支持的操作，应明确标记以避免诊断工具误操作；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求详细定义每个DID的支持级别，以确保诊断通信的准确性和安全性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01102</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:48c74c4c-af6a-4b71-bc9b-55fb8128518c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidSupportInfoLen</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Length of the support information in bytes.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidSupportInfoLen配置项用于定义诊断服务中数据标识符（DID）的支持信息长度，即DID的支持信息所占用的字节数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，DcmDspDidSupportInfoLen的值应当与实际DID支持信息的长度相匹配；如果设置不正确，可能会导致诊断响应格式错误或信息丢失；此配置项通常由诊断通信管理模块的开发者或配置工程师根据具体的DID和诊断需求来设定。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01103</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4a806b69-a477-41e1-b26c-2dc2cc3e3c5d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidSupportInfoPos</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Length of the support information in bytes.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidSupportInfoPos配置项用于定义数据标识符（DID）在诊断服务中的支持信息位置，这有助于诊断服务确定如何处理特定的DID。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidSupportInfoPos时，需要确保DID与其支持信息位置的映射是唯一的，以避免在诊断通信过程中的任何歧义；此外，应当遵循AUTOSAR标准中对于DID支持信息的规定，确保配置的兼容性和正确性；在实际应用中，还需考虑DID支持信息位置对于诊断工具的影响，以确保工具能正确解析和使用DID。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01100</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:43f188f9-3fc9-422a-bfe9-916a49e698b5">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of the DID's Info</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidInfo配置项用于定义诊断数据标识符（DID）的属性，包括DID的读取、写入和控制权限，以及与之相关的服务和子功能。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidInfo时，需要确保DID与其属性的匹配正确，遵循ISO 14229和AUTOSAR标准中对服务和子功能的定义；此外，对于安全相关的DID，还需配置相应的安全访问级别；在配置过程中，还应注意DID的唯一性，避免与其他DID冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00607</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a5303b44-4753-447c-96fb-d6f09118e3ba">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidDynamicallyDefined</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Indicates if this DID can be dynamically defined</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidDynamicallyDefined配置项用于定义动态数据标识符（Dynamic Data Identifier, DID）的属性，这些DIDs可以在车辆运行时通过诊断服务动态定义。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保动态定义的DIDs不与静态定义的DIDs冲突；动态DIDs的管理需要遵循诊断服务的规范；对于动态DIDs的存储和恢复机制，应当考虑车辆断电后的数据持久性要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">true = DID can be dynamically defined
                                                        false = DID can not be dynamically defined</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00612</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f288c540-e490-43ee-b39c-218468225cff">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDDDIDMaxElements</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Maximum number of source elements of a DDDID.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDDDIDMaxElements配置项定义了动态定义数据标识符（Dynamic Data Identifier, DDDID）中最大元素的数量，这是用于诊断通信中，允许在一个DDDID中动态定义的最大数据元素数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保此配置项的值不超过实际系统能够处理的最大元素数量；过高的值可能会导致系统资源不足，而过低的值可能限制了DDDID的灵活性和功能性；此配置项的设置应考虑到ECU的内存和处理能力。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00970</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
