                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:9893d9cc-5ec6-4b1e-aa9a-4f4ce2186ab5">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidControl</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of the DID control.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidControl配置项用于定义诊断数据标识符（DID）的控制属性，包括控制选项和相关的服务处理规则，以便在车辆诊断通信中对DID执行控制操作。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidControl时，需要确保控制选项与DID支持的控制类型相匹配；应注意与DcmDspDidInfo配置项的一致性，以确保正确的服务响应；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，控制操作可能受到安全访问（Secured Access）的限制，因此配置时应考虑安全策略的要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00619</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f11c91bd-98a4-42e1-9886-8b18e734ba84">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidFreezeCurrentState</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This indicates the presence of &quot;FreezeCurrentState&quot;.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidFreezeCurrentState配置项用于定义诊断服务是否支持冻结当前数据标识符（DID）的状态，这允许在诊断会话期间暂时保存DID的当前值。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在实现此功能时，需要确保ECU具备足够的资源来存储冻结的DID值；此配置项的使用应符合车辆制造商的诊断策略和要求；在配置时应注意与其他诊断服务的兼容性和数据一致性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00624</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b0af4ede-42df-49e9-bce1-b9f1ae64720a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidResetToDefault</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This indicates the presence of &quot;ResetToDefault&quot;.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidResetToDefault配置项用于定义诊断服务中重置数据标识符（DID）到其默认值的行为，确保在执行特定的诊断请求时，能够将DID恢复到预设的默认状态。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保DID支持重置到默认值的操作；重置操作可能会影响系统的正常运行，需谨慎设计；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与DID相关的安全访问权限设置相匹配，以避免安全风险。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00623</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:08c8f967-cfdb-4d08-b94a-7e44eb5bc050">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidShortTermAdjustment</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This indicates the presence of &quot;ShortTermAdjustment&quot;.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidShortTermAdjustment配置项用于定义诊断会话中，对数据标识符（DID）的短期调整参数和行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项必须确保与车辆的安全和隐私要求相符合；调整操作应在授权的诊断会话中进行，避免未授权访问；在实施时需考虑对系统性能的影响，确保不会对其他系统功能造成干扰。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00625</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a4a4577c-0fa0-43db-8b0c-6f81e6f54de7">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidControlMask</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This indicates the presence of &quot;controlEnableMask&quot; in SWC service interfaces and defines how the Dcm treats a service request.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidControlMask配置项用于定义诊断服务中数据标识符（DID）的控制选项掩码，它决定了哪些位可以被客户端（如诊断工具）控制。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidControlMask时，需要确保掩码与DID支持的控制选项相匹配；掩码中的每个位代表DID的一个特定控制功能，因此需要仔细设计以避免不必要的功能暴露；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果该属性与DID的实际功能或安全要求不一致，可能会导致诊断服务的安全性问题。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01059</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>DCM_CONTROLMASK_INTERNAL</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <LITERALS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:5ccb7900-6bb7-8f64-6708-2afadbdb8a5d">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_CONTROLMASK_EXTERNAL</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:51be224c-eb9c-9aee-3de7-da5a8e454ffc">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_CONTROLMASK_INTERNAL</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:8fdbc63c-6aea-95b3-6136-21dcc76cab92">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_CONTROLMASK_NO</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                  </LITERALS>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ccc31197-c09a-4287-8b47-56fdf87257f2">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidControlMaskSize</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">The value defines the size of the controlEnableMaskRecord in bytes.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidControlMaskSize配置项定义了用于DID控制操作的掩码大小，该掩码用于确定哪些位可以被控制。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：掩码大小应与DID的大小相匹配，以确保正确的操作；在配置掩码时，需要注意数据的字节序；掩码大小的配置必须符合ECU支持的数据长度限制。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01060</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
