                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f58af94a-b6c8-4471-be91-f395cd0775ee">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidControlRole</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Bitfield were each bit represents one dedicated role. A DID is granted IOcontrol access if the bit value is 1. If a bit value is 0, the DID is not allowed to be controlled for that role.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidControlRole配置项定义了数据标识符（DID）的控制权限，用于指定哪些会话层或安全访问级别可以对DID执行控制操作。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidControlRole时，需要确保控制权限与项目的安全需求相匹配；此外，应当注意不同DID可能需要不同的控制权限设置；在配置时还应考虑到会话层的变化，确保在不同会话下DID的控制权限得到正确管理。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01143</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
