                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:eb73f9ba-2b42-44bd-82d9-f6e64ccfd968">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidReadVehicleSystemGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Defines DID read operation availability dependency to a specific VSG.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidReadVehicleSystemGroupRef配置项用于定义诊断服务中，读取数据标识符（DID）时所关联的车辆系统组引用。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的车辆系统组在系统中已定义且有效；此配置项应与具体的DID及其读取权限和安全策略一致；在配置时需考虑数据的安全性和访问权限控制。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">If there is no reference, no check of vsg shall be done.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_10014</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
