                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspVehicleSystemGroup/DcmDspVehicleSystemGroupRow</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:04fc31e3-85a0-4bbd-ac0f-0f3a5798d69b">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidWrite</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of the DID write.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidWrite配置项用于定义诊断服务中数据标识符（DID）的写操作属性，包括写入权限、写入条件和相关的回调函数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidWrite时，需要确保写入权限符合系统安全要求；写入条件应与实际应用场景相匹配，避免在不适当的时机允许写操作；回调函数需要正确实现，以确保写入操作的数据处理符合预期。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00616</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1b5386d5-3462-4f29-b2e3-8b5c4ce95ed3">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidWriteRole</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Bitfield were each bit represents one dedicated role. A DID is granted write access if the bit value is 1. If a bit value is 0, the DID is not allowed to be written for that role.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidWriteRole配置项定义了数据标识符（DID）的写入权限，用于控制对特定DID的写入访问，确保只有授权的客户端可以修改DID的值。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidWriteRole时，需要确保权限设置符合应用的安全要求；此外，应考虑与DcmDspDidReadRole的配置一致性，以保证读写权限的合理性；最后，需要注意的是，任何修改都应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中关于数据访问权限的规定。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01142</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:2276e1dc-64b6-4ec5-bfa1-95fb9aa012a4">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidWriteModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmModeRule</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidWriteModeRuleRef配置项用于引用一个规则，该规则定义了数据标识符（DID）写入操作的条件，确保只有在满足特定条件时才能对DID执行写入操作。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidWriteModeRuleRef时，需要确保引用的规则已经在系统中定义；规则的定义应符合AUTOSAR的诊断事件管理和服务请求管理要求；此外，对于写入操作的安全性和合法性要求较高，因此需要仔细设计和验证引用的规则。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Mode rule which controls to write this DID. If there is no reference, no check of the mode rule shall be done.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00922</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
