                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:36cab054-7aa7-498a-89c2-407f92efd01f">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidRangeWriteDidFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Function name to request application to write the data range value of a DID.(WriteData-function).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidRangeWriteDidFnc配置项用于定义在诊断服务中，当写入数据标识符（DID）属于一个特定范围时，所调用的函数名称。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspDidRangeWriteDidFnc时，需要确保所引用的函数符合AUTOSAR标准中对服务处理函数的要求；函数需要能够处理请求的写入操作，并返回适当的诊断响应码；此配置项通常与DcmDspDidRange定义关联，确保DID范围与对应的处理函数匹配。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Only relevant if DcmDspDidRangeUsePort is set to false. This parameter is related to the interface Xxx_WriteDidData.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00948</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
