                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ea8801b6-7167-4f00-9610-49f5b05815a3">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidRangeIdentifierLowerLimit</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Lower limit of DID range.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidRangeIdentifierLowerLimit 用于定义诊断数据标识符（DID）范围的下限，这有助于确定哪些DID可以被访问和处理。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保设置的下限值不低于允许的最小DID值；在配置DID范围时，下限值应小于或等于上限值DcmDspDidRangeIdentifierUpperLimit；适当配置此值以避免数据访问冲突或安全问题。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00938</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d19253b6-c9fd-42cd-b611-4c58d1e9bc9b">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidRangeIdentifierUpperLimit</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Upper limit of DID range.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidRangeIdentifierUpperLimit用于定义诊断数据标识符（DID）范围的上限，这是在配置诊断服务时，用于指定可接受的DID范围的最大值。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值必须大于或等于DcmDspDidRangeIdentifierLowerLimit的值；确保配置的DID范围不与其他已配置的DID范围重叠；在配置时考虑实际应用中可能需要的DID范围，避免将来的扩展需求导致配置修改。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00939</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0970ab28-2e00-406c-8797-961ef9963baa">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDidRangeMaxDataLength</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Maximum data length in bytes</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspDidRangeMaxDataLength配置项用于定义在诊断服务中，动态定义数据标识符（DID）范围的最大数据长度，这是为了确保在读取或写入数据时，数据块的大小不会超过ECU处理能力。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此参数时，必须确保它反映了ECU的实际数据处理能力和存储限制；超出此长度的数据请求可能会被诊断服务拒绝；此参数的设置应与ECU的内存和性能特性相匹配，以避免潜在的通信或操作问题。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00940</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
