                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:085afa40-ea34-4a4c-b23e-1536b862f954">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspEcuReset</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration for DcmDspEcuReset service</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspEcuReset配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中ECU复位服务的参数，包括复位类型、复位时间以及与之相关的诊断服务请求和响应行为。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspEcuReset时，需要确保复位类型与ECU支持的复位方式相匹配；复位时间参数应符合系统复位需求和诊断规范；此外，还需注意与安全访问服务的交互，确保在执行复位前满足安全级别要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01111</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c7349acf-7bac-4d09-b2f5-1a4536d08603">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspEcuResetRow</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration for each DcmDspEcuReset subservice.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspEcuResetRow配置项用于定义ECU重置类型及其相关属性，如重置服务的支持情况、安全访问级别和会话控制要求等，以便在诊断通信过程中正确处理ECU重置请求。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保为每种重置类型正确配置安全访问级别和会话控制要求，以避免未授权的重置操作；在配置时需考虑ECU的实际能力和安全要求，以确保配置的合理性和安全性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对ECU重置的处理和配置有明确规范，需遵循标准以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01112</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4fa83ea3-1e30-4010-ac5d-be376675a6a0">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmResponseToEcuReset</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Defines the answer to EcuReset service should come: Before or after the reset.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmResponseToEcuReset配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）如何响应来自外部测试设备的ECU重置请求，包括重置类型和执行后的行为。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmResponseToEcuReset时，需要确保所选的重置类型与ECU支持的重置类型相匹配；对于安全相关的重置请求，应确保适当的安全措施被实施，以防止未授权的重置操作；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于ECU重置的响应行为应详细定义，以避免在重置后出现不可预期的行为。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01039</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <LITERALS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:0f459a59-3612-9167-65d3-2752f7c0326f">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>AFTER_RESET</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:26c560b4-7bb8-8faf-5c87-9e4cc2c472cb">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>BEFORE_RESET</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                  </LITERALS>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7989695d-5049-49c1-b2ad-aa38e7af4a6d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspEcuResetId</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Defines the subfunction ID</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspEcuResetId 是用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中ECU重置类型的标识符，它指定了执行ECU重置时所需的服务标识符和选项。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspEcuResetId时，需要确保其值与ISO 14229标准中定义的ECU重置服务标识符一致；此外，应当检查与该重置类型相关的所有依赖性和权限设置，以确保在执行重置时系统的安全性和一致性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，还应注意与诊断事件管理和诊断操作周期的兼容性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01113</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>127</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ec1fa387-9234-4e73-9987-2e7b0fc49c4b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMemory</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of the memory access.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMemory配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中与内存操作相关的属性，例如读取或写入ECU内存的权限、地址范围以及内存大小等。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspMemory时，需要确保内存地址范围和大小与ECU实际硬件资源相匹配；权限设置应符合安全和诊断策略要求；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，可能需要考虑与SecOC模块的安全通信集成。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00784</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:7ca165d2-6df2-9715-3b2e-f268b689a8d0">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspAddressAndLengthFormatIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of the supported AddressAndLengthFormatIdentifiers for memory access.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00963</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:453077e0-4a9c-deac-eccf-91df7d7f4492">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSupportedAddressAndLengthFormatIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the supported AddressAndLengthFormatIdentifier of the request message.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00964</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3e7f9318-71e8-4f79-94d4-630cd06c37f7">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMemoryIdInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Provides the value of memory identifier used to select the desired memory device</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMemoryIdInfo配置项用于定义诊断服务中内存标识符的属性，包括内存地址范围和内存大小，用于支持读写内存服务（如服务10、3D）中对不同内存区域的访问控制。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：内存标识符必须唯一，以避免在诊断会话中对内存区域的访问冲突；配置的内存地址范围和大小应与实际硬件资源相匹配，确保诊断访问的有效性和安全性；在配置时需考虑不同安全访问级别对内存访问的限制。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of the memory access  requested through diagnostic services : ReadMemoryByAddress,  WriteMemoryByAddress, and DynamicallyDefineDataIdentifier</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00911</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:e6cc5afc-65ea-475c-8cc6-65b98377f4aa">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMemoryIdValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Value of the memory device identifier used.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Each DcmDspMemoryIdInfo should have a unique ID.

                                                                The MemoryIdValue is retrieved from the request messages (RMBA,WMBA,RD,RU,DDDI) according to ISO-14229-1 with the most significant byte of the request parameter memoryAddress.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00913</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3369be1c-0533-44f5-bb59-9a368dd5492e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspReadMemoryRangeByLabelInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Provides a memory range allowed for reading via labels (lower and higher address configured as strings).</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspReadMemoryRangeByLabelInfo是一个配置项，用于定义诊断服务中读取内存范围的参数，包括内存地址、大小以及相关的访问权限标签。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保内存地址和大小的正确性，以避免对系统的非法访问或潜在的内存损坏；访问权限标签应与系统的安全策略相匹配，确保只有授权的诊断会话能够访问对应的内存区域；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能对内存读取服务的实现和配置有特定的要求，需要仔细参照标准文档进行配置。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01068</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:64762858-8218-40af-bb08-0bf9ea87c72d">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspReadMemoryRangeByLabelHigh</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">High memory address as label (string) of a range allowed for reading.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspReadMemoryRangeByLabelHigh配置项用于定义诊断服务中读取内存范围的上限地址，这是在执行读取内存范围（ReadMemoryByAddress）服务时，通过标签指定的内存地址的最高可能值。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需确保上限地址不低于对应的DcmDspReadMemoryRangeByLabelLow配置的下限地址；地址范围应符合ECU内存布局和安全访问要求；此配置应与ECU的实际物理内存地址和访问权限相匹配，避免配置超出实际可访问的内存范围。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01070</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                                          <REGULAR-EXPRESSION>[a-zA-Z0-9_]([a-zA-Z0-9\._])*</REGULAR-EXPRESSION>
                                        </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f5998887-f8f3-43c2-bd17-029a8d586348">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspReadMemoryRangeByLabelLow</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Low memory address as label (string) of a range allowed for reading.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspReadMemoryRangeByLabelLow配置项用于定义诊断服务中读取内存范围请求的最低地址标签，它指定了允许读取的内存地址下限。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保该地址低于或等于对应的DcmDspReadMemoryRangeByLabelHigh配置项中的地址，以保证内存读取范围的有效性和安全性；此外，地址应当符合ECU内存地址空间的实际分布，避免指向非法或保护区域；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置与ECU的内存映射和安全访问权限设置一致。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01069</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
