                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4777b026-33d5-41c8-a707-ab5ffb488fbc">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspReadMemoryRangeInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Provides the range of memory address allowed for reading</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspReadMemoryRangeInfo配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中读取内存范围的参数，包括内存地址、大小以及相关的安全访问权限。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspReadMemoryRangeInfo时，需要确保内存地址和大小的定义不会超出实际的物理或应用程序内存范围；必须考虑到安全访问权限，以防止未授权的内存访问；此外，应当检查与ECU内存映射的一致性，确保诊断请求能够正确地访问指定的内存区域。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00785</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:008e069b-c3d1-43e1-b1ba-772e5c4374f6">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspReadMemoryRangeHigh</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">High memory address of a range allowed for reading</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspReadMemoryRangeHigh配置项用于定义诊断服务中读取内存范围的上限地址，确保诊断请求只能访问允许的内存区域。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保上限地址不低于对应的DcmDspReadMemoryRangeLow配置项中的下限地址；地址范围应符合ECU内存布局和安全要求；在配置多个内存范围时，要避免地址范围重叠。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00787</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>4294967294</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a515ce30-cf94-41bb-a490-12f99cb56815">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspReadMemoryRangeLow</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Low memory address of a range allowed for reading</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspReadMemoryRangeLow配置项用于定义诊断服务读取内存范围的最低地址限制，确保内存读取操作在允许的地址范围内进行。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspReadMemoryRangeLow时，需要确保该地址低于或等于对应的DcmDspReadMemoryRangeHigh配置项以定义有效的地址范围；此外，应检查ECU内存映射和安全访问权限，以确保配置的地址是可访问和允许读取的；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，地址值应符合ECU的内存寻址能力和数据类型限制。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00786</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>4294967294</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:9e446f31-c1b3-41f1-88c9-214aa2385a59">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspReadMemoryRangeModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmModeRule</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspReadMemoryRangeModeRuleRef配置项用于定义诊断服务读取内存范围时应用的模式规则引用，确保在执行读取内存操作时，满足特定的条件或权限限制。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要与Dcm的安全访问和会话控制策略相匹配，确保只有在适当的诊断会话和安全访问级别下才能读取特定的内存范围；在配置时需确保引用的模式规则存在且正确；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中对于权限管理和安全性有更加严格的要求，需要仔细检查与之相关的配置。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                        <SDGS>
                                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                          </SDG>
                                        </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Mode rule which controls read  access on this memory address. If there is no reference, no check of the mode rule shall be done.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00920</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
