                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:cd4a03e1-470f-4534-81e5-5e95cf7b093d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeByLabelInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Provides a memory range allowed for writing via labels (lower and higher address configured as strings).</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeByLabelInfo配置项用于定义诊断服务中写入内存范围的参数，包括内存地址、大小以及访问权限等信息，以支持对特定内存区域的写操作。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保内存地址和大小的正确性，避免对系统的其他部分造成意外的影响；必须正确设置访问权限，以防止未授权的访问；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与安全和诊断需求紧密结合，确保配置的安全性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01073</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2d826025-c062-44d2-8470-6f67423db8f0">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeByLabelHigh</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">High memory address as label (string) of a range allowed for writing.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeByLabelHigh配置项用于定义诊断服务中写入内存操作的上限地址标签，它指定了可以通过诊断服务写入的内存区域的最高地址。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保该地址范围内的内存可被安全写入，且不会影响系统的稳定性；地址标签应与实际的内存布局相匹配，避免因地址错误导致潜在的内存损坏；在配置多个内存范围时，应保证它们之间不会重叠，以防止写入操作的冲突。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01075</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                                          <REGULAR-EXPRESSION>[a-zA-Z0-9_]([a-zA-Z0-9\._])*</REGULAR-EXPRESSION>
                                        </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3ee52339-f21b-418e-8777-b9df3991620c">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeByLabelLow</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Low memory address as label (string) of a range allowed for writing.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeByLabelLow配置项用于定义诊断服务中写入内存操作的最低地址限制，确保内存写入操作不会超出预设的地址范围。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保地址范围与实际可写入的内存区域相匹配，避免因地址错误导致系统不稳定或安全问题；此配置项应与DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeByLabelHigh一起使用，以定义一个完整的内存写入范围；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果该配置项的属性与标准定义不一致，可能会导致诊断服务无法正确执行内存写入操作。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01074</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
