                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ade4f19b-2bab-49ff-9c2c-1426ed1a6c20">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Provides the range of memory address allowed for writting.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeInfo配置项定义了诊断服务中写内存操作的范围信息，包括可写的内存地址范围和相关的安全访问级别。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保内存地址范围不与其他服务或应用的内存使用冲突；必须正确配置安全访问级别，以防止未授权访问；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与诊断安全需求相一致，确保配置的安全性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00789</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1be6862c-91d8-412d-97b9-f0f109bb6a6b">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeHigh</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">High memory address of a range allowed for writing.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeHigh配置项用于定义诊断服务中写入内存操作的最高内存地址范围，确保诊断请求只能访问允许的内存区域。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保该地址范围与实际可写内存区域相匹配，避免潜在的安全风险；该配置项通常与DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeLow一起使用，以定义一个完整的内存写入范围；在多内存区域的系统中，可能需要配置多个写内存范围对。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00791</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>4294967294</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3730e663-93d0-4e4c-914c-3d4519c40f23">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeLow</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Low memory address of a range allowed for writing</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeLow配置项用于定义诊断服务中可写内存地址的最低边界，确保内存写入操作的地址范围在允许的区域内。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeLow时，必须确保该值不低于ECU内存地址空间的最小边界；同时，该值应与DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeHigh配合使用，以定义一个有效的写入内存范围；此外，应考虑ECU的安全策略，以防止未授权的内存写入操作。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00790</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>4294967294</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:c229aba4-8cfd-4889-8e4e-65064c4175e0">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmModeRule</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeModeRuleRef配置项用于引用特定的诊断会话和安全访问级别规则，这些规则定义了在哪些条件下允许对内存范围进行写操作。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspWriteMemoryRangeModeRuleRef时，需要确保引用的诊断会话和安全访问级别规则与实际的应用场景相匹配；引用的规则必须在Dcm配置中预先定义；违反这些规则可能导致诊断服务的写操作被不正确地限制或允许。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                        <SDGS>
                                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                          </SDG>
                                        </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">Mode rule which controls write access on this memory address. If there is no reference, no check of the mode rule shall be done.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00916</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
