                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f1e65050-6620-4133-befc-250b1d0a2a4d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMemoryTransfer</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of the memory transfer.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMemoryTransfer配置项是用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中内存传输操作的参数，这包括读取、写入和擦除内存操作的相关配置。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspMemoryTransfer时，需要确保内存范围、访问权限和传输协议符合ECU的硬件和软件要求；此外，应当注意内存操作可能对系统的实时性和安全性产生影响，因此需要仔细规划和测试；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能对内存传输的数据大小、安全访问机制和传输协议有特定的要求或限制，需要遵守这些规范以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01132</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f0992a50-de2b-4c54-8db0-262020c3cfb9">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMemoryTransferUsePort</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If this parameter is set to true, the Dcm uses a port requiring a PortInterface UploadDownload.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMemoryTransferUsePort配置项用于指定诊断服务组件（Dcm）在执行内存传输操作时是否使用端口接口。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当确保该配置项与系统中实际使用的内存传输机制相匹配；如果系统设计要求通过端口接口与其他软件组件交互进行内存读写，该选项应配置为启用；反之，如果系统使用直接内存访问方式，则应配置为禁用。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">If the parameter is false, the DCM uses the according C-API callouts.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01133</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:49d1929d-6e98-4e2f-8801-852152af9ca0">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMemoryTransferFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Function name for memory transfer services.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMemoryTransferFnc配置项用于定义诊断服务中的内存传输功能，它指定了用于读取、写入和擦除内存的函数指针，以便在诊断会话中执行内存操作。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspMemoryTransferFnc时，需要确保提供的函数指针与实际实现的内存操作函数相匹配；此配置项通常与Dcm的内存映射和安全访问权限设置紧密相关；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循模块的内存和安全管理策略来配置此项，以确保诊断服务的正确性和安全性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Only relevant if DcmDspMemoryTransferUsePort is set to false.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01134</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                              </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8268129b-41de-89d5-60a3-e8f8c3cf36d2">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspAddressAndLengthFormatIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of the supported AddressAndLengthFormatIdentifiers for memory access.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspAddressAndLengthFormatIdentifier配置项用于定义诊断服务中地址和长度信息的格式，这决定了如何解析从客户端接收到的数据以及如何构建响应消息。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需要确保所选格式与客户端期望的格式一致；格式标识符必须符合ISO 14229标准中定义的规范；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，应当检查该配置项是否支持新的或者已经废弃的格式标识符。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00963</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4af724a9-1e88-d16c-1244-886f8ac4d294">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSupportedAddressAndLengthFormatIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the supported AddressAndLengthFormatIdentifier of the request message.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSupportedAddressAndLengthFormatIdentifier配置项用于定义诊断服务处理器（Diagnostic Service Processor）支持的地址和长度格式标识符，这有助于确保诊断请求和响应中的数据格式正确解析和处理。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项必须与车辆支持的诊断协议一致；不正确的配置可能导致诊断通信失败；在实现时需考虑诊断请求的多样性和兼容性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00964</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6b92c3f8-9f7c-4112-8afb-8ec756daa89e">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMemoryTransferIdInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Provides the value of memory identifier used to select the desired memory device</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMemoryTransferIdInfo配置项用于定义诊断服务中内存传输操作的标识符信息，这些信息用于支持不同的内存传输请求，如读取内存或写入内存。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspMemoryTransferIdInfo时，需要确保每个内存传输标识符与其对应的内存操作类型、地址范围和权限设置匹配；标识符应唯一，以避免在内存传输服务中的冲突；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能对内存传输的数据大小、对齐和安全访问有特定要求，这些应在配置时考虑。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of the memory access  requested through diagnostic services :
                                                        RequestDownload, RequestUpload, TransferData, RequestTransferExit</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01137</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:25ed95d8-573f-4b04-a8be-dbdb18d68c38">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMemoryIdValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Value of the memory device identifier used.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMemoryIdValue 是用于配置诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，内存标识符的值，该值用于区分不同的内存块，如EEPROM、闪存等，以便在执行读写内存服务时能够正确地访问对应的内存区域。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspMemoryIdValue时，需要确保内存标识符的值与实际硬件和ECU内存映射一致；标识符的值应该是唯一的，不应与其他内存块的标识符冲突；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循相关的诊断协议标准（如ISO 14229）中对内存标识符的规定。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Each DcmDspMemoryIdInfo should have a unique ID.

                                                                The MemoryIdValue is retrieved from the request messages (RMBA,WMBA,RD,RU,DDDI) according to ISO-14229-1 with the most significant byte of the request parameter memoryAddress.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01138</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e83a3c94-b636-4b64-9246-6478224476e3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPeriodicTransmission</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for Periodic Transmission Scheduler.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPeriodicTransmission配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的周期性数据传输属性，这包括周期性传输的数据和时间间隔等。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置周期性传输时，需要确保数据的传输周期符合网络带宽和ECU处理能力的限制；应遵循相关的诊断协议标准，如ISO 14229；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，应确保配置与标准中定义的模块和参数兼容。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00957</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9fc7022a-9ea0-4b45-913b-a1d9e5abfcb0">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPeriodicTransmissionFastRate</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter give the transmission rate of the requested periodicDataIdentifiers to be used if the parameter transmissionMode given in the ReadDataByPeriodicID request is equal to 0x03 (&quot;sendAtFastRate&quot;). This parameter value in seconds have to be configured as a multiple of DcmTaskTime.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPeriodicTransmissionFastRate配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，快速周期性数据传输的速率，即在快速周期性消息传输模式下，ECU发送周期性数据的时间间隔。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应当符合车辆网络的带宽和ECU处理能力；过快的传输速率可能导致网络拥塞或ECU处理瓶颈；在配置时需遵循相关诊断协议标准和OEM的具体要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">min:
                                                        A negative value and zero is not allowed.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00960</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.255</MAX>
                              <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">1E-4</MIN>
                            </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:8b066e1f-82ba-4c30-8225-957c27421208">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPeriodicTransmissionMediumRate</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter give the transmission rate of the requested periodicDataIdentifiers to be used if the parameter transmissionMode given in the ReadDataByPeriodicID request is equal to 0x02 (&quot;sendAtMediumRate&quot;). This parameter value in seconds have to be configured as a multiple of DcmTaskTime.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPeriodicTransmissionMediumRate配置项用于定义诊断通信管理（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，周期性数据传输的中等速率，即在周期性传输控制中，中等速率的数据传输频率。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值需要根据网络带宽和ECU处理能力合理设置，以避免数据传输过程中的拥堵或丢失；在不同的车辆网络（如CAN、Ethernet等）中，合理的速率设置可能会有所不同，需要根据具体的网络特性进行调整；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于周期性传输的速率类别进行了定义，但具体数值需要根据实际应用场景和性能要求来确定。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">min:
                                                        A negative value and zero is not allowed.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00959</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.255</MAX>
                              <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">1E-4</MIN>
                            </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7634035a-f6d9-4cbb-9c18-eb928860ce9c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPeriodicTransmissionSlowRate</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter give the transmission rate of the requested periodicDataIdentifiers to be used if the parameter transmissionMode given in the ReadDataByPeriodicID request is equal to 0x01 (&quot;sendAtSlowRate&quot;). This parameter value in seconds have to be configured as a multiple of DcmTaskTime.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPeriodicTransmissionSlowRate配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，慢速速率下的周期性数据传输的时间间隔，通常用于控制车辆诊断时数据更新的频率。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应当根据车辆网络的带宽和诊断需求来设置，以确保网络不会因为过高的数据传输频率而过载；在设置时需要考虑到不同诊断会话模式下的数据传输要求，以及可能的诊断策略变化；如果配置的值与实际车辆网络的性能不匹配，可能会导致诊断响应时间延迟或通信失败。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">min:
                                                        A negative value and zero is not allowed.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00958</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.255</MAX>
                              <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">1E-4</MIN>
                            </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0c07240b-5341-4794-bfe7-123dba73cbd7">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspMaxPeriodicDidScheduler</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the maximum number of periodicDataIdentifiers that can be scheduled concurrently.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspMaxPeriodicDidScheduler配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，最大周期性数据标识符（DID）调度器的数量，这决定了可以同时激活的周期性DID传输的最大数量。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保该值不超过ECU处理能力和网络带宽限制；该值应与实际应用中需要支持的周期性DID数量相匹配；超出此配置的周期性DID请求可能会被拒绝或导致系统性能下降。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00962</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
