                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:aeb4b8e9-646b-4ac1-b418-45b2c9095682">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPidDataSupportInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container defines the supported information.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPidDataSupportInfo配置项用于定义诊断服务中参数标识符（PID）的支持信息，包括PID是否被支持以及如何读取PID的数据。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspPidDataSupportInfo时，需要确保PID符合车辆制造商的诊断需求；对于不支持的PID，应明确标记以避免诊断工具错误识别；配置信息应与ECU支持的实际能力相匹配，避免诊断通信中的数据不一致问题。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00874</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0528c4ee-4c59-4584-b721-9aece91a87af">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPidDataSupportInfoBit</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Referenced Bit of the SupportInfo</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPidDataSupportInfoBit配置项用于决定在诊断服务中，特定的PID（Parameter Identifiers）是否支持数据流的“支持信息位”。这通常用于指示一个数据标识符是否可用于车辆的诊断数据流。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspPidDataSupportInfoBit时，需要确保它与车辆支持的PID列表相匹配；此配置项的设置必须符合OBD（On-Board Diagnostics）要求，如果适用；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的诊断协议标准，如ISO 15031-5或ISO 14229-1，以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00876</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>255</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                  <REFERENCES>
                                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:034797fc-7ffe-4728-8b4c-80272fc81a73">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPidDataSupportInfoRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmDspPidSupportInfo</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPidDataSupportInfoRef是一个配置项，用于引用支持特定诊断服务标识符（PID）的数据元素的信息，以便在诊断通信中正确处理和响应PID请求。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的数据元素信息与实际支持的PID匹配，以保证诊断服务的正确性；在配置时需注意数据元素的访问权限和安全级别，以满足诊断安全要求；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与诊断服务的需求和实现紧密相关，确保配置的一致性和准确性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00875</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspPid/DcmDspPidSupportInfo</DESTINATION-REF>
                                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                  </REFERENCES>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ca6c8ae1-28a1-48ef-aa3d-dd78e538d056">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPidService01</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Contains specific configuration parameter of PID for service $01. This container exists only if DcmDspPidService is set to DCM_SERVICE_01 or DCM_SERVICE_01_02.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPidService01配置项是用于定义诊断服务$01（读取数据流）中的参数标识符（PID），它指定了哪些数据应当被读取并返回给诊断工具。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspPidService01时，需要确保PID符合车辆制造商的要求以及相关法规标准；PID的数据类型和长度必须与ECU提供的数据匹配；在配置过程中，还需注意PID之间的依赖关系和数据一致性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00894</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:57fbffab-73fe-4388-9758-5720e092df05">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspPidDataEndianness</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines the endianness of the data belonging to a PID in a diagnostic response message.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspPidDataEndianness配置项用于定义诊断服务中参数标识符（PID）数据的字节序，确保数据的正确解析和交换。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保字节序与ECU内部数据处理的字节序一致；不同平台间的数据交换可能需要考虑字节序转换；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准支持大端和小端字节序，但具体选择应基于目标平台和应用需求。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                                        <SDGS>
                                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                          </SDG>
                                        </SDGS>
                                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">If no DcmDspPidDataEndianness is defined the value of DcmDspDataDefaultEndianness is applicable.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01012</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
