                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:13d818f0-ecea-4ff7-8317-969436471e86">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestControl</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of the &quot;Request control of on-board system, test or component&quot; service (Service $08).</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestControl配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中请求控制服务的属性，这些属性包括请求控制服务的支持情况、安全性访问级别以及会话控制等。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRequestControl时，需要确保配置的安全访问级别和会话控制与实际的诊断需求相匹配；此外，AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能对支持的服务代码和子功能代码有特定的要求或限制，因此需要根据标准进行配置；最后，确保配置的参数与ECU支持的诊断功能一致，避免因配置错误导致诊断服务无法正常工作。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The DCM will request the control using an R-Port requiring a PortInteface RequestControlServices_{Tid}.
                                                The R-Port is named RequestControlServices_{Tid}
                                                where {Tid} is the name of the container DcmDspRequestControl.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00637</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2f94ccf4-0cb5-4c86-99fc-e793686be311">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestControlInBufferSize</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Number of bytes to be provided in the input buffer of the interface RequestControlServices_{Tid} for OBD Service $08</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestControlInBufferSize配置项用于定义诊断服务处理请求时，输入缓冲区的大小，这个缓冲区用于存储来自诊断测试仪的请求数据。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：缓冲区大小需要根据实际支持的诊断服务和数据长度来配置，以确保能够处理最大可能的请求；过小的缓冲区可能导致无法处理大的诊断请求，而过大的缓冲区可能会浪费系统资源；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应确保该配置项与ECU的内存和处理能力相匹配。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00722</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f79e1629-9470-4138-952a-70d91531afb3">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestControlInfoByte</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Manufacturer specific value reported to the tester for the record identifiers 0xE000 to OxE1FF. (WWH-OBD use cases)</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestControlInfoByte配置项用于定义诊断服务请求中控制信息字节的属性，这通常包括控制参数的类型和大小，用于控制ECU行为。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRequestControlInfoByte时，必须确保控制参数的类型和大小符合ECU的实际需求和诊断标准；此配置项的属性应与实际的诊断请求匹配，避免诊断通信中的错误；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对诊断服务的定义非常严格，因此在配置时应仔细参考相关规范文档。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01078</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:283f299d-8ef0-4f97-869e-b2080cb9c6ba">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestControlOutBufferSize</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Number of bytes to be provided in the output buffer of the interface RequestControlServices_{Tid} for OBD Service $08</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestControlOutBufferSize 定义了诊断控制服务（如重置或控制ECU操作）的输出缓冲区大小，用于存储响应数据。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：缓冲区大小应足以容纳最大可能的响应数据；过小的缓冲区可能导致数据截断，影响诊断服务的执行；在配置时需考虑ECU的处理能力和响应时间。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00723</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c3bae093-cf45-436a-a3a2-ab9f15c935eb">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestControlTestId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Test Id for Service $08</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestControlTestId用于定义诊断服务中请求控制操作的测试标识符，它指定了在执行控制操作时需要使用的特定测试ID。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该标识符必须在Dcm配置中唯一，以确保诊断请求的正确处理；在配置时需遵循ISO 14229标准中定义的服务标识符和参数要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中并未对此项进行特殊的修改或限制，但实现时应确保与整体诊断策略和架构兼容。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00656</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
