                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b211345f-c5d7-48cb-8fea-e80915429989">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestFileTransfer</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration for RequestFileTransfer.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestFileTransfer配置项用于定义诊断服务中请求文件传输的参数，包括文件传输的模式、内存地址、大小等信息，以支持文件的上传或下载过程。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保文件传输请求的参数与实际应用场景相匹配，避免因参数不当导致传输失败；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对文件传输服务的支持可能受限于ECU的硬件能力和网络带宽，需谨慎评估；配置应遵循安全传输原则，确保数据在传输过程中的安全性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This container only exists if RequestFileTransfer is configured.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01034</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:802f42d1-d67d-45b2-8ddd-b8ddde90b4c7">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmRequestFileTransferUsePort</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines if a C/S or C function call shall be used for RequestFileTransfer processing.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmRequestFileTransferUsePort配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，文件传输请求的使用端口，以便在诊断会话中支持文件的上传或下载功能。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要与诊断服务的实现紧密配合，确保端口配置正确以支持预期的文件传输操作；在配置时需考虑安全性，确保数据传输过程中的数据保护；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确列出，用户需参考相关诊断通信服务的配置要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01131</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:98b04b15-134c-44a4-b3a4-67ff506fbd54">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmRequestFileTransferFileSizeOrDirInfoParameterLength</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the length (number of bytes, i.e. the value of fileSizeOrDirInfoParameterLength) of the fileSizeUncompressedOrDirInfoLength and fileSizeCompressed in the response of RequestFileTransfer.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmRequestFileTransferFileSizeOrDirInfoParameterLength配置项用于定义在文件传输或目录信息请求中，文件大小或目录信息参数的长度。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此参数时，需要确保其长度符合实际应用中文件大小或目录信息的表示需求；长度配置应遵循相关诊断协议标准；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应检查此参数是否与最新的诊断服务要求保持一致。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01035</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>4</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <MAX>4</MAX>
                              <MIN>1</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0a9b1ee7-8aeb-41b2-9983-7e1386fd6c00">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmRequestFileTransferLengthFormatIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the length (number of bytes) of the maxNumberOfBlockLength parameter in the response of RequestFileTransfer.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmRequestFileTransferLengthFormatIdentifier用于定义在诊断通信中，文件传输请求的长度字段的格式，确保文件传输过程中长度信息的准确传递。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应根据实际的文件传输协议和需求来设置，以确保兼容性和正确性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需注意与其他诊断服务的兼容性和整体诊断策略的一致性；长度格式标识符的选择直接影响到传输效率和协议的灵活性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01036</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>4</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <MAX>4</MAX>
                              <MIN>1</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:28af9db8-c24f-4a0f-8383-cb961cf52e9b">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmRequestFileTransferMaxFileAndDirName</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the maximum size allowed for the FileAndDirName parameter with RTE interfaces used for RequestFileTransfer.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmRequestFileTransferMaxFileAndDirName配置项定义了在使用诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）进行文件传输请求时，允许的最大文件和目录名长度。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值需要根据实际应用场景和系统资源进行合理设置，以避免因名称过长导致的内存溢出或处理失败；超出此长度的文件或目录名将导致文件传输请求被拒绝；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的设置符合诊断协议要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01130</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>1</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>1</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:9885fba5-071c-4c7c-83e6-329c8fc8c580">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoe</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Provide the configuration of the ResponseOnEvent mechanism.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoe配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的响应式事件（Response On Event）功能，该功能允许在预定义的车辆事件发生时自动触发诊断响应。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRoe时，必须确保与车辆的事件检测系统兼容；此功能的实现必须遵守相关的安全和隐私标准；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对此功能的支持可能有特定的限制或要求，需要详细查阅标准文档。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00858</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fbf5e8d4-807e-48aa-98cb-bcb6ac707afa">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeInterMessageTime</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Provide the minimum time in seconds between two transmissions of ROE event. It is used for the delay between two different consecutive Roe transmissions.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeInterMessageTime配置项用于定义诊断通信中，响应输出扩展(ROE)服务之间消息的最大允许时间间隔。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该时间间隔必须足够短，以确保系统能够及时响应ROE服务请求；过长的时间间隔可能导致诊断通信效率降低或超时错误；该配置项的具体值需根据系统性能和网络带宽合理设置。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00856</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">5</MAX>
                              <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4501e8a7-b4f8-44fe-9b7e-2e99672a3993">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeEvent</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains a list of all supported Roe eventTypeRecords which are accepted by this ECU.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeEvent配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的响应On事件（Response On Event）功能，它指定了在特定条件下触发的诊断响应事件。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：ROE功能需要确保ECU支持并且已经激活；在配置ROE事件时，必须确保事件的唯一性和与诊断需求的一致性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对ROE的支持可能受限于具体的ECU硬件和软件能力，需仔细核对。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">At most one DcmDspRoeEvent container is allowed to define a DcmDspRoeEventProperties  container with the choice DcmDspRoeOnDTCStatusChange.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00973</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ff5ea9fb-fe3d-440c-8749-1484f0f0df2f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeInitialEventStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Initial Roe status of this RoeEvent</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeInitialEventStatus配置项用于定义诊断事件在系统启动时的初始状态，这决定了诊断事件是否在系统启动后立即激活。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的设置对系统的诊断响应行为有直接影响；确保与系统的安全和诊断需求相匹配；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的属性应与系统设计文档中的要求一致，否则可能导致诊断功能不符合预期。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00980</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>DCM_ROE_CLEARED</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <LITERALS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:aea9ec20-15fe-8901-50d3-3978f38ed3e7">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_ROE_CLEARED</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:0851c18c-9f8a-915d-56d3-a4be8362dfd7">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_ROE_STOPPED</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                  </LITERALS>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:06508669-0f1d-426d-b3af-4696186ce82e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeEventId</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">EventId for a global identification of this ROE event it is used within APIs Dcm_TriggerOnEvent() and the ModeDeclarationGroup.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeEventId配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的响应OnEvent（ROE）功能的事件标识符，这是用于区分不同ROE事件的唯一标识。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRoeEventId时，必须确保事件标识符的唯一性，以避免在诊断会话中对事件的混淆；此外，ROE事件标识符的范围和分配应符合ISO 14229标准中定义的要求；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当检查与ROE相关的其他配置参数，如DcmDspRoeEventLogic和DcmDspRoeEventWindowTime，以确保ROE功能的正确实现。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The ratio Ids should be sequentially ordered beginning with 0 and no gaps in between.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00976</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>254</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:89b1b4c5-9578-44b2-9c0d-3f764173ac64">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeEventProperties</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the properties of Roe eventTypeRecords.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeEventProperties配置项定义了诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中响应On Event（ROE）服务的事件属性，包括事件类型、事件窗口时间以及事件记录的相关参数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ROE事件时，需要确保事件类型与诊断需求相匹配；事件窗口时间必须设置在合理范围内，以避免对系统性能造成不利影响；此外，应当注意存储空间的分配，确保事件记录能够被正确保存和处理。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">In one DcmDspRoeEventProperties container one DcmDspRoeOnDTCStatusChange or DcmDspRoeOnChangeOfDataIdentifier container shall be defined.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00978</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <CHOICES>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2de1af96-e18b-4992-bd2d-6d608813cf2a">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeOnChangeOfDataIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the eventTypeRecord supported for onChangeOfDataIdentifier eventType.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeOnChangeOfDataIdentifier 用于定义诊断通信管理系统中，当数据标识符发生变化时，如何响应和执行相关的诊断服务。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保数据标识符的变化能够被正确监测和识别；配置应符合车辆制造商的诊断策略和安全要求；在实现时需考虑系统资源和响应时间的优化。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00975</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <REFERENCES>
                                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:319308df-3ca2-4ace-a8ab-ebae56cac1a5">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeDidRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a Did which is watched.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeDidRef配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，与事件相关数据标识符（DID）相关联的参考，这使得在诊断事件发生时能够报告特定的DID。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRoeDidRef时，需要确保引用的DID已在诊断系统中定义并且有效；此配置项通常与诊断事件管理相关，因此需要与DcmDspRoeEvent配置项协同工作；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于诊断服务的配置有严格的规范，因此在配置时应遵循标准的要求以确保诊断服务的正确性。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00979</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspDid</DESTINATION-REF>
                                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                      </REFERENCES>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a46af3b9-67b4-47ad-814e-a554e3ad2a8f">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeOnDTCStatusChange</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the eventTypeRecord supported for onDTCStatusChange eventType.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeOnDTCStatusChange配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，当故障诊断码（DTC）的状态发生变化时是否启动响应式事件报告（Response On Event, ROE）功能。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要确保与车辆的故障管理策略相一致；在实现时需考虑对网络带宽和ECU处理能力的影响；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对ROE的支持和配置要求可能与早期版本有所不同，需要仔细核对标准文档。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00974</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <PARAMETERS>
                                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a83807ca-f15c-45c4-9b56-66d5791a676c">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeDTCStatusMask</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Value of the relevant DTCStatusMask</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeDTCStatusMask配置项用于定义诊断事件记录器（DTC）的状态掩码，这个掩码决定了哪些DTC状态变化会触发响应事件的记录。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRoeDTCStatusMask时，需要确保掩码与实际应用中需要监控的DTC状态相匹配；AUTOSAR标准可能对可用的DTC状态掩码值有具体要求，需仔细参考相关文档；错误配置可能导致某些DTC状态变化未能正确触发事件记录，影响诊断准确性。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01109</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                      </PARAMETERS>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                  </CHOICES>
                                </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8fa75901-d836-4eb6-b5a8-21995cd169a8">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeEventWindowTime</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container configures the available EventWindowTime in this Ecu.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">This container contains a sub-set of EventWindowTimes supported by the Dcm, to limit the Ecu resources.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00981</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2adf0ec3-7d20-460f-b8f0-e692a51e97c2">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoeEventWindowTime</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Value of the EventWindowTime</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoeEventWindowTime配置项用于定义诊断事件记录功能中，响应事件触发后的时间窗口，在此时间窗口内的事件将被记录或处理。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的时间单位和精度应符合项目具体要求；在配置时需考虑系统的实时性和处理能力，避免设置过长的时间窗口导致系统资源紧张；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于DcmDspRoeEventWindowTime的具体数值范围没有强制要求，但建议根据实际应用场景合理配置。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00982</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <LITERALS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:63824b5f-714a-97e3-74a9-1ce0fddc67b4">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_ROE_EVENT_WINDOW_CURRENT_AND_FOLLOWING_CYCLE</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:c6cabc86-75ad-99d8-44db-f8a95920859a">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_ROE_EVENT_WINDOW_CURRENT_CYCLE</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:a42fd5a8-f910-9978-4791-06a2f6cbc1fc">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_ROE_EVENT_WINDOW_INFINITE</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                  </LITERALS>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:28d866b1-d42d-44f8-a3be-e05510d9cef4">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoutine</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for Routines</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoutine配置项用于定义诊断服务组件中的例行控制服务，它指定了例行控制服务的属性，如例行控制操作的标识符、支持的子功能以及相关的执行条件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRoutine时，需要确保例行控制标识符的唯一性，避免与其他服务或例行控制冲突；根据AUTOSAR标准，应正确配置支持的子功能，如启动、停止、请求结果等；还需注意与实际的硬件和应用层软件的兼容性，确保例行控制操作能够正确执行。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00640</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d1c3a0c1-f010-44f4-920d-9a3aa8528dd0">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoutineUsed</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Allow to activate or deactivate the usage of a Routine, for multi  purpose ECUs</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoutineUsed配置项用于指定诊断例程是否在诊断通信管理器（Dcm）中被使用，以支持车辆诊断服务中的特定功能。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保只有必要的诊断例程被标记为使用，以优化资源和性能；在配置时需遵循OEM的诊断策略和标准；不正确的配置可能导致诊断服务不可用或行为异常。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">True = Routine is available
                                                        False = Routine is not available</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00807</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:00ea77d8-037e-4045-91a8-013b03aac509">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoutineUsePort</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If this parameter is set to true, the DCM uses a port requiring a PortInterface RoutineServices_{RoutineName}.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoutineUsePort配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Dcm）中的诊断例程是否使用端口（Port）与其他软件组件进行通信，以实现特定的诊断功能。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保当诊断例程需要与其他软件组件交互时，正确配置DcmDspRoutineUsePort为true；如果诊断例程不需要与其他组件交互，则可以将其设置为false以减少系统开销；配置时需考虑诊断例程的实际需求，避免不必要的端口通信开销。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">The R-Port is named RoutineServices_{RoutineName}
                                                        where {RoutineName} is the name of the container DcmDspRoutine
                                                        In that case, the configuration must not provide function names in DcmDspStartRoutineFnc, DcmDspStopRoutineFnc or DcmDspRequestResultsRoutineFnc.
                                                        If this is false, the DCM expects to find the names of the functions to be used in DcmDspStartRoutineFnc, DcmDspStopRoutineFnc or DcmDspRequestResultsRoutineFnc.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00724</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9bb602ee-9693-42a8-970d-f386134562c1">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoutineIdentifier</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">2 bytes Identifier of the RID</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRoutineIdentifier配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的例程标识符，它关联了特定的诊断例程，允许对车辆的ECU执行特定的测试和操作。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRoutineIdentifier时，必须确保例程标识符的唯一性，避免与其他诊断例程冲突；应当遵循OEM的诊断规范来分配例程标识符；在实施例程控制时，还需考虑例程的权限管理和安全访问要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Within each DcmConfigSet all DcmDspRoutineIdentifier values shall be unique.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00641</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
