                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:04455938-dcea-437a-aef2-9ba5d50b3976">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsRole</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Bitfield were each bit represents one dedicated role. A RoutineControl with sub-function requestResults is granted access if the bit value is 1. If a bit value is 0, the routine is not allowed for that role.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsRole配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Dcm）中，特定例程请求结果的角色和权限，确保只有授权的客户端可以请求和接收诊断例程的执行结果。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保角色与权限设置符合系统安全要求；不同的诊断例程可能需要不同的权限设置，以满足不同安全级别的需求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于诊断服务的安全要求较高，需要特别注意权限配置的合规性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01146</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
