                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e71f1173-93dd-4575-b232-0ca836780b10">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsCommonAuthorizationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmDspCommonAuthorization</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsCommonAuthorizationRef 是一个配置项，用于引用授权配置，该配置定义了对诊断例程结果请求的访问权限。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，需要确保引用的授权配置与所需的安全级别相匹配；如果配置了不正确的授权引用，可能会导致安全访问控制不当，从而允许未授权的访问；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的安全和访问控制规范来配置此项。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Common authorization configuration taken from the referenced DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsCommonAuthorizationRef. If there is no reference, no check on the commonly defined authorization conditions shall be done to get the routine result.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01054</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
