                                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                                      <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                              </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2761816e-07fa-d0c9-d446-485551ecb9b2">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspAlternativeDiagnosticDataElement</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of an alternative Diagnosis Representation by the means of Diagnostic Extract.</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01084</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <REFERENCES>
                                                <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:11cf24c2-9328-1ec6-86e6-e3f4830d0786">
                                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDiagnosticDataElementRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                                  <DESC>
                                                    <L-2 L="EN">Alternative Diagnosis Representation for the data defined by the means of a DiagnosticDataElement in the Diagnostic Extract.</L-2>
                                                  </DESC>
                                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                                    <P>
                                                      <L-1 L="EN">This EcucForeignReference enables the access to all SwDataDefProps, in particular BaseType, CompuMethod and DataConstr

                                                                                                The CompuMethod and DataConstr that applies to the referenced DiagnosticDataElement will be applied to the data type of the VariableDataPrototype in the interface used by the Dcm.
                                                                                                The mapped ImplementationDataType needs to match the given BaseType.</L-1>
                                                    </P>
                                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01085</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                  <DESTINATION-TYPE>DIAGNOSTIC-DATA-ELEMENT</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                                </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                              </REFERENCES>
                                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                          </CHOICES>
                                        </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b81e2e39-1a5d-4b38-841c-bb54791d739f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsOut</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Provide description of output parameter of RequestResult subservice for RoutineControl service.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsOut配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中请求例行控制结果输出的参数，这涉及到UDS服务的例行控制功能，特别是服务$31的子功能&quot;请求结果&quot;。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsOut时，需要确保其与例行控制操作的其他参数和设置相匹配；此配置项应与车辆制造商的诊断需求和规范一致；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于诊断服务的配置应遵循标准的数据结构和参数定义，以确保诊断通信的正确性和互操作性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00831</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d16350f2-f67c-4b4b-b1fb-1d752b4c3641">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsOutSignal</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Provides description of a routine signal used in RoutineControl service.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsOutSignal 用于定义诊断服务中请求例程结果的输出信号，这些信号用于通知外部设备或系统例程的执行结果。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保信号与ECU的实际输出能力相匹配；在设计时考虑信号的实时性和可靠性；遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对诊断信号的具体要求和格式。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The ordering defined via the index attribute of the subcontainers in this list represents the order of the dataOutN elements in the XXX_RequestResult function call.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00836</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
