                                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b469cb7e-0fe7-d921-f6f4-84f23ae99ccf">
                                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspAlternativeDiagnosticDataElement</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of an alternative Diagnosis Representation by the means of Diagnostic Extract.</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01084</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                              <REFERENCES>
                                                <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:9ed76ed2-9b15-271e-a995-20916c09eaa3">
                                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspDiagnosticDataElementRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                                  <DESC>
                                                    <L-2 L="EN">Alternative Diagnosis Representation for the data defined by the means of a DiagnosticDataElement in the Diagnostic Extract.</L-2>
                                                  </DESC>
                                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                                    <P>
                                                      <L-1 L="EN">This EcucForeignReference enables the access to all SwDataDefProps, in particular BaseType, CompuMethod and DataConstr

                                                                                                The CompuMethod and DataConstr that applies to the referenced DiagnosticDataElement will be applied to the data type of the VariableDataPrototype in the interface used by the Dcm.
                                                                                                The mapped ImplementationDataType needs to match the given BaseType.</L-1>
                                                    </P>
                                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01085</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                                  <DESTINATION-TYPE>DIAGNOSTIC-DATA-ELEMENT</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                                                </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                                              </REFERENCES>
                                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                          </CHOICES>
                                        </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d6d2aed0-2224-4705-8247-640cdcb0e132">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutine</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Provides the configuration of Start subservice for RoutineControl service.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutine配置项用于定义诊断服务组件中启动例程的参数，包括例程标识符、例程选项和例程状态管理等，以支持对车辆控制单元进行诊断和配置。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspStartRoutine时，必须确保例程标识符的唯一性，避免与其他诊断例程冲突；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，需要正确配置例程的权限和安全访问级别，以保证只有授权的诊断会话能够启动特定例程；此外，对于支持异步执行的例程，应正确处理例程执行状态和结果报告，以避免诊断通信中的数据不一致。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01021</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:dda64cad-a2c3-4587-9d67-570faf6bd0d0">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutineConfirmationEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Allows to enable/disable the confirmation function to indicate the transmission of a response to a StartRoutine request</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutineConfirmationEnabled 是一个配置项，用于确定是否启用诊断服务组件（Diagnostic Service Component）中的启动例行控制操作的确认响应。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保此配置项与诊断例行控制需求相匹配；如果不需要确认响应，可以禁用以节省资源；正确配置此项对于满足诊断通信规范至关重要。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01093</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:c590457b-79b1-4ef5-bdca-01788684ef30">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutineConfirmationFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">C-function to call if a transmission confirmation is needed by the issuer (BSW module)</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutineConfirmationFnc配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Diagnostics Communication Manager）中启动例程确认函数的名称，该函数用于确认启动例程是否成功执行。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：函数名称需要遵循C语言命名规则且不应与其他函数名冲突；确保该函数实现与AUTOSAR标准中定义的启动例程确认函数的接口一致；在配置时需注意与DcmDspStartRoutine函数的配合使用，以确保例程控制逻辑的正确性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01094</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
