                                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                  </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:522ca244-9f31-4989-9efb-435a072f00d8">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutineFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Function name for request to application to start a routine. (Routine_Start-function)</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutineFnc配置项用于定义诊断服务中启动例程的函数，这是在诊断会话中执行特定服务例程的入口点。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保该函数与实际的硬件或软件服务例程兼容；在配置时应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4的标准接口规范；在多任务环境中，注意该函数的执行时间和资源竞争问题。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">This parameter is related to the interface Xxx_Start.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00664</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
