                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:31f0c58c-77e5-423e-a9b8-5637fccd5728">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutineCommonAuthorizationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmDspCommonAuthorization</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutineCommonAuthorizationRef 是一个配置项，用于引用在启动诊断例程之前必须满足的授权条件，以确保只有在得到适当授权后才能执行诊断服务。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时，必须确保引用的授权条件已经定义在系统中；授权机制应与安全访问需求相匹配，以防止未授权的访问；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果该配置项的属性或使用方式与标准不一致，需要检查并更新以确保符合标准要求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Common authorization configuration taken from the referenced DcmDspStartRoutineCommonAuthorizationRef. If there is no reference, no check on the commonly defined authorization conditions shall be done to start the routine.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01052</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
