                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspCommonAuthorization</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:08fe0499-fff8-4788-9b44-b49a1669e579">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutineIn</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Provide description of input parameter of Start subservice for RoutineControl service</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutineIn配置项用于定义诊断服务中启动例行控制操作的输入参数，这些参数指定了例行控制服务（RoutineControl）的启动条件和所需数据。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspStartRoutineIn时，必须确保输入参数与例行控制服务的要求相匹配；参数类型和大小应符合AUTOSAR标准和具体例行控制服务的定义；在多例行控制服务中，应注意不同服务的输入参数可能会有不同的配置需求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00834</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f8e215d7-bca4-4335-a9f8-2a16d889bd15">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutineInSignal</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Provide description of a routine signal used in RoutineControl service.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutineInSignal配置项用于定义启动诊断例程时的输入信号，它指定了在启动诊断服务例程时需要传递给例程的输入参数。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspStartRoutineInSignal时，需要确保信号的数据类型、大小和格式与例程的输入参数要求相匹配；此配置项通常与DcmDspRoutineInfo相关联，需要保证它们之间的一致性；在配置过程中，还应注意AUTOSAR标准中对服务例程输入信号的任何特定要求或限制。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The ordering defined via the index attribute of the subcontainers in this list represents the order of the dataInN elements in the XXX_Start function call.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00845</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                      <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                                      <PARAMETERS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a1bf8cad-84bf-4a1e-8935-ecf1753a9a80">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspRoutineSignalEndianness</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the endianness of the data belonging to a Routine In Signal for Start subfunction.</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <ADMIN-DATA>
