                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2854544c-0a0d-47ee-bf60-90ad3177ff23">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutineOut</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Provide description of output parameter of Start subservice for RoutineControl service.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutineOut配置项用于定义诊断服务中启动例程的输出参数，它指定了在执行启动例程服务（如ECU重置或激活某些操作）后返回给客户端（通常是诊断工具）的数据。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspStartRoutineOut时，必须确保输出参数与实际启动例程的预期输出匹配；对于不同的启动例程，可能需要配置不同的输出参数；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对诊断服务的参数有详细规范，需要遵守这些规范以确保诊断服务的兼容性和正确性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00835</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f4bc8fee-5cbd-44f7-9981-aafc6ec0042c">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStartRoutineOutSignal</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Provide description of a routine signal used in RoutineControl service.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStartRoutineOutSignal 用于定义诊断服务中启动例程的输出信号，这些信号用于向客户端报告例程的执行结果。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保输出信号与诊断例程的实际功能和预期输出一致；在配置时需考虑信号的数据类型和范围，以确保正确的数据传输；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，应遵循标准的诊断信号配置规范。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The ordering defined via the index attribute of the subcontainers in this list represents the order of the dataOutN elements in the XXX_Start function call.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00848</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                      <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                                      <PARAMETERS>
                                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6d3957b3-7c15-49b9-aaef-cf4851aef251">
