                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f3baefcb-ac88-4374-900c-9c966838564a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStopRoutineCommonAuthorizationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Reference to DcmDspCommonAuthorization</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStopRoutineCommonAuthorizationRef配置项用于引用授权方法，这些方法用于在执行诊断停止例程前验证是否有权限执行该操作。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保引用的授权方法与实际的安全需求相匹配；在配置时需注意引用的授权方法必须已在系统中定义；不正确的授权配置可能导致安全风险。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">Common authorization configuration taken from the referenced DcmDspStopRoutineCommonAuthorizationRef. If there is no reference, no check on the commonly defined authorization conditions shall be done to stop the routine.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01053</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
