                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspCommonAuthorization</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                              <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:790be7f2-8f29-45bb-9218-3d04b02a1c40">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStopRoutineIn</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Provide description of input parameter of Stop subservice for RoutineControl service.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStopRoutineIn配置项用于定义诊断服务中停止例程的输入参数，确保正确的参数被传递以执行停止操作。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：输入参数应与相应的服务文档或标准一致；参数类型和长度必须正确配置以避免数据解析错误；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保该配置项的使用符合诊断通信管理器（DCM）模块的规范要求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00832</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:9ee3dd2a-d4cb-4293-a851-abc6329c93ea">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspStopRoutineInSignal</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Provide description of a routine signal used in RoutineControl service.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspStopRoutineInSignal配置项用于定义诊断服务中停止例程的信号，它指定了在执行停止例程操作时，哪些信号应当被发送给ECU以停止相应的诊断例程。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspStopRoutineInSignal时，必须确保信号与所需停止的诊断例程匹配且符合ECU的处理能力；此配置项对于实现诊断服务的正确性至关重要，错误的配置可能导致诊断例程无法正确停止；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于诊断例程的信号处理有明确规范，需要确保配置符合标准要求。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <INTRODUCTION>
                                        <P>
                                          <L-1 L="EN">The ordering defined via the index attribute of the subcontainers in this list represents the order of the dataInN elements in the XXX_Stop function call.</L-1>
                                        </P>
                                      </INTRODUCTION>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00839</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
