                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a3214e87-2a9b-4001-93d2-78fb6a08ee65">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSecurityKeySize</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">size of the security key (in Bytes).</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSecurityKeySize配置项用于定义诊断安全访问（Security Access）服务中使用的密钥的大小，通常以字节为单位，这个参数决定了安全算法处理的密钥长度。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，密钥大小应该与实际使用的安全算法和车辆制造商的安全要求相匹配；密钥长度的选择会影响到安全性和性能，因此需要仔细考虑；如果配置的密钥大小不支持所选的安全算法，可能会导致诊断安全访问服务无法正常工作。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00760</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>4</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                                  <MIN>1</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:66824058-9cbc-4135-af5e-cd82e1fce8f4">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSecurityLevel</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Value of Security level.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSecurityLevel配置项定义了诊断服务中的安全访问级别，用于控制对敏感操作或数据的访问权限，确保只有经过授权的用户才能执行特定的诊断服务。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspSecurityLevel时，必须确保安全级别的唯一性和递增性，避免安全级别之间的冲突；应根据实际应用需求合理设置安全级别，以满足系统的安全要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对安全级别的具体数值和含义有明确规定，配置时需遵循这些规定以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The locked state cannot be configured explicitly.

                                                                1,2,3...63:
                                                                configuration dependent - Conversion formula to calculate SecurityLevel out of tester requested

                                                                SecurityAccessType parameter:
                                                                SecurityLevel = (SecurityAccessType (requestSeed) + 1) / 2

                                                                Type: Dcm_SecLevelType</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00754</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
