                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7b5f352e-7805-4caa-ae72-b028ff9e9e04">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSecurityNumAttDelay</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Number of failed security accesses after which the delay time is activated</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSecurityNumAttDelay配置项用于定义在Diagnostics Communication Manager (DCM) 模块中，当安全访问请求失败达到一定次数后，需要等待的延迟时间才能再次尝试安全访问。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该延迟时间用于防止恶意攻击，确保车辆的诊断安全；配置的延迟时间应符合具体应用场景的安全要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的使用应确保与安全策略和法规要求相一致。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00762</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
