                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3139748b-16d0-4289-904c-e55df380307a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSecuritySeedSize</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">size of the security seed (in Bytes).</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSecuritySeedSize配置项定义了诊断安全服务中种子（Seed）的大小，这是用于车辆诊断安全认证过程中的关键参数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：种子大小应符合车辆制造商的安全要求和标准；不正确的种子大小可能导致安全认证失败；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，种子大小应确保与安全算法兼容。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00755</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>4</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                                  <MIN>1</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1c2b9411-34d4-4916-8d60-9ee215a4d685">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSession</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Parent container holding single rows to configure particular sessions</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSession配置项用于定义诊断会话控制服务（Diagnostic Session Control, Service ID 0x10）中的会话类型，包括会话的名称、时间参数以及与会话相关的安全访问级别。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspSession时，需要确保会话类型符合ISO 14229标准中定义的会话层次结构；每个会话类型应有唯一的会话控制类型标识符；还需注意会话之间的切换条件和对应的安全访问级别，以确保诊断功能的正确性和安全性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00769</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1017e86d-517b-4231-819d-eed434578579">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSessionRow</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container holds all parameters needed to configure a single session</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSessionRow配置项定义了诊断会话控制服务（Diagnostic Session Control service）中的会话类型及其属性，用于控制诊断会话的行为和访问权限。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个会话类型的配置与实际应用需求相匹配，避免配置不当导致诊断功能异常；会话类型的切换应考虑到安全性和权限管理，防止未授权访问；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中对会话的管理和配置有详细规定，需要遵守相关规范以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00767</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>31</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7736a593-bcd3-409a-bb96-f19ab86bd64a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSessionForBoot</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines whether this diagnostic session allows to jump to Bootloader (OEM Bootloader or System Supplier Bootloader) and determines, from which unit the final response will be sent.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSessionForBoot配置项用于定义诊断会话控制服务（Diagnostic Session Control service）中，用于启动引导会话的会话级别。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保配置的会话级别与系统支持的引导加载器会话一致；引导会话通常用于ECU编程，因此需要特别注意安全和授权机制；此配置项的使用应符合ECU的引导和编程策略。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">If this diagnostic session doesn't allow to jump to Bootloader the value DCM_NO_BOOT shall be chosen.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00815</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC V1.0.0</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>DCM_NO_BOOT</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <LITERALS>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:6b0570e4-a3bd-84a7-0345-44faf5721043">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_NO_BOOT</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:079471d7-1eee-8410-251e-e7845ea5a172">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DCM_OEM_BOOT</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                  </LITERALS>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1ad492a7-aa3f-451a-89c4-5b43f738e78e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSessionP2ServerMax</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is the session value for P2ServerMax in seconds (per Session).</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSessionP2ServerMax配置项定义了诊断通信控制器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）在非默认会话中等待客户端（tester）请求的最大时间（P2ServerMax时间），超过这个时间没有收到请求则会认为通信超时。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该时间值应根据具体的车辆网络环境和诊断需求进行配置；超时时间设置过短可能导致正常请求被错误地判定为超时，设置过长可能影响系统的响应性能；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的单位通常是毫秒，确保与标准一致。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The AUTOSAR configuration standard is to use SI units, so this parameter is defined as a float value in seconds. DCM configuration tools must convert this float value to the appropriate value format for the use in the software implementation of DCM.
                                                                This value is reported to the tester within the response to the 'Session Control' service.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00766</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">1</MAX>
                                  <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:77f633ae-92b8-499e-8f55-1f5d9b91ce86">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSessionP2StarServerMax</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This is the session value for P2*ServerMax in seconds (per Session).</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSessionP2StarServerMax配置项定义了在非默认会话中，服务器最大的P2*定时器时间，即服务器在接收到请求后，最长可以等待多久来发送响应。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该时间必须大于或等于DcmDspSessionP2ServerMax的值；配置值应考虑网络延迟和处理时间，以避免通信超时；在配置时需确保符合具体项目或标准的要求，避免设置过短导致通信失败。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The AUTOSAR configuration standard is to use SI units, so this parameter is defined as a float value in seconds. DCM configuration tools must convert this float value to the appropriate value format for the use in the software implementation of DCM.
                                                                This value is reported to the tester within the response to the 'Session Control' service.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00768</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">100</MAX>
                                  <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a5e7a413-940d-452d-844a-3eadb78dc288">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSessionLevel</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">subFunction value of the DiagnosticSession.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSessionLevel配置项用于定义诊断会话控制服务（Diagnostic Session Control service）中支持的会话级别，这些级别决定了在特定会话中可以执行的诊断服务集合。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspSessionLevel时，需要确保定义的会话级别与ISO 14229标准中定义的会话级别相匹配；每个会话级别应该有唯一的标识符，以避免在诊断通信中的混淆；还需要注意会话级别之间的切换条件和权限，确保诊断安全性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">0, 127 and all values above 127 are reserved by ISO</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00765</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>126</MAX>
                                  <MIN>1</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:ab9e9d45-6a15-471b-b53c-688c573c1f5f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspSessionResponseMultiplePendingFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Function name to support responsing multiple pendings of service 0x10 02.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspSessionResponseMultiplePendingFnc配置项用于指定一个函数，该函数负责0x10 02服务支持多个0x78响应的回调函数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该函数需要支持对应的协议号，在实现时应确保对协议号的使用是合法的，以防止异常的发生；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，该函数的实现应遵循模块的定义和安全要求。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">This parameter is related to the interface DspUdsDiagnosticSessionControl.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01048</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                  </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:32313828-f69c-485e-beed-44f57d7b09b3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for one single VehicleInfoType of service $09</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehInfo配置项用于定义车辆信息服务（Vehicle Information Service）的参数，这些参数包括车辆制造商的信息、车辆型号、VIN码等，它们通常在诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）模块中使用。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspVehInfo时，需要确保所提供的车辆信息符合相关法规和标准要求；配置的信息应当与车辆实际参数一致，以避免诊断通信中的错误；此外，应注意保护车辆信息的安全性，防止通过诊断接口泄露敏感信息。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00630</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:dbbd8ba6-3be8-40e4-bd67-00f5936ee167">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehInfoNODIProvResp</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Indicate the Dcm, which side is responsible to fill the number of data items (NODI), Dcm or the provider of the InfoType data. In case the responsibility is on provider side, only one DcmDspVehInfoData container is allowed.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehInfoNODIProvResp配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）在处理车辆信息请求时，如果没有可提供的数据项（NODI），应如何响应。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，必须确保在配置此项时考虑到系统的安全性和隐私要求；配置应遵循OEM的具体策略和法规要求；在设计响应策略时，应考虑到可能的网络带宽和性能影响。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">* true: Provider is responsible for providing the number of data items parameter
                                                        * false or not existing: Dcm is responsible for providing the number of data items parameter</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01051</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:55de5580-4a51-4397-947f-dac7f1b51dd9">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehInfoInfoType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">value of InfoType.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehInfoInfoType 用于定义车辆信息服务中的信息类型，这些信息类型用于诊断通信中的车辆信息请求。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspVehInfoInfoType时，确保信息类型符合ISO 14229标准中定义的车辆信息服务要求；此配置项应与车辆制造商的诊断需求一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，应注意其与DcmDspVehInfo服务的兼容性和正确实现。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Within each DcmConfigSet all DcmDspVehInfoInfoType values shall be unique.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00631</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:65b82b67-71ec-4004-a527-f42af8a5a344">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehInfoData</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Data Item of an InfoType; ShortName is post-fix of the port interface name.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehInfoData配置项用于定义车辆信息服务（Vehicle Information Service）中，特定信息类型的数据属性，如数据长度和格式，它指定了诊断服务如何读取和报告车辆的特定信息。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspVehInfoData时，必须确保数据长度和格式与车辆实际可提供的信息相匹配；此配置项对于实现诊断通信中的车辆信息服务至关重要，错误的配置可能导致诊断通信失败；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于诊断数据的处理和传输有严格规定，需要仔细遵守。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00888</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:183a2e34-4c24-49bd-9b7e-ce71f1a93ba0">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehInfoDataUsePort</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">When this parameter is set to true the DCM will access the Data using an R-Port requiring a PortInterface IInfotypeServices_{VehInfoData}.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehInfoDataUsePort配置项用于定义诊断服务组件（Dcm）中，车辆信息服务（Vehicle Information Service）获取数据的接口方式，指定是通过端口（Port）还是直接从内部或外部数据源读取。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保选择的数据接口方式与系统架构和数据源兼容；配置时需考虑数据实时性和安全性要求；若使用端口方式，需确保端口配置正确且与数据源接口匹配。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The R-Port is named InfotypeServices_{VehInfoData} where {VEHINFODATA} is the name of the container DcmDspVehInfoData. In that case, the DcmDspVehInfoDataReadFnc is ignored and the RTE APIs are used.

                                                                When this parameter is set to false, the DCM calls the function defined in DcmDspVehInfoDataReadFnc.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00727</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:87ac237a-d475-4822-b2b8-1559f2e9e408">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehInfoDataReadFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Callout function name for reading InfoType data item. Only required in case parameter 'DcmDspVehInfoDataUsePort' is set to 'false'</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehInfoDataReadFnc配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，读取车辆信息数据的函数。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保实现的函数符合OEM的车辆信息数据要求；函数应处理可能的错误和异常情况；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，该函数的接口和行为应严格遵循标准规范。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00889</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                                  </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                                </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3b7c81ff-fe62-48db-bf13-38a7d6bf7d31">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehInfoDataOrder</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Defines the order of the data item in the InfoType; values: 0..255; first data item having the order number 0; the next 1 and so on.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehInfoDataOrder配置项用于定义车辆信息服务（Vehicle Information Service）中，请求的数据元素的返回顺序。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspVehInfoDataOrder时，必须确保数据元素的顺序与客户端的期望和标准文档中定义的顺序一致；如果顺序配置错误，可能会导致客户端解析数据时出现问题；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于车辆信息服务的数据顺序有明确的规定，需要遵守这些规定以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                                    <SDGS>
                                      <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                        <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                      </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                                  <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
                                      <L-1 L="EN">The configuration of order needs to be unique per InfoType.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                  </INTRODUCTION>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00891</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:96ca3a8c-97c5-4c9f-a896-a6e7170ab512">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehInfoDataSize</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Size in bytes of the InfoType data item.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehInfoDataSize配置项用于定义车辆信息服务（Vehicle Information Service）中，每个车辆信息类型（Vehicle Information Type）的数据大小。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspVehInfoDataSize时，需要确保数据大小与实际车辆信息类型的数据长度一致；超出或低于实际数据长度的配置可能导致数据读取错误或内存溢出；此配置项应与车辆制造商的规范和诊断需求文档保持一致。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00890</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>0</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8300cc5e-9449-474d-9bbb-417d8dad66d2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehicleSystemGroup</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container includes all Dcm related Vehicle System Groups (VSGs)</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehicleSystemGroup配置项用于定义诊断服务组件中，与车辆系统相关的组配置信息，它允许对不同的车辆系统进行分组管理，以便在执行诊断服务时能够针对特定的系统组进行操作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspVehicleSystemGroup时，需要确保每个系统组的标识符（ID）是唯一的，以避免在诊断会话中的冲突；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能对系统组的属性有特定要求，需仔细参考标准文档以确保兼容性；在实际应用中，应根据具体的诊断需求合理划分系统组，以优化诊断效率和准确性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_10010</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2f0f58f8-70a4-4425-a778-fcfa12c48a9c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehicleSystemGroupRow</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Represents a single Vehicle System Group (VSG) related to Dcm</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehicleSystemGroupRow配置项用于定义诊断服务组件中，车辆系统组的属性，包括系统组的标识符和对应的服务处理函数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个DcmDspVehicleSystemGroupRow配置项中的系统组标识符唯一，以避免在诊断会话中的冲突；该配置项应与车辆的实际系统架构相匹配，确保诊断功能的正确实现；在配置时需考虑系统的安全性要求，避免未授权访问敏感系统组。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_10011</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0209e177-4d29-4ecb-9f60-e53bcec8fda9">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspVehicleSystemGroupId</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Specifies an abstract ID of the corresponding Vehicle System Group.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDspVehicleSystemGroupId配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，车辆系统组的唯一标识符，这有助于在执行诊断服务时区分不同的车辆系统组。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmDspVehicleSystemGroupId时，必须确保每个系统组的标识符是唯一的，以避免在诊断过程中出现标识符冲突；此外，标识符应与车辆制造商的诊断规范保持一致，以确保诊断工具能够正确识别和访问相应的系统组；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的模块配置规则和数据约束，以保证系统的兼容性和互操作性。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_10012</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                    <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                      <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                    </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                  <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                  <MAX>255</MAX>
                                  <MIN>1</MIN>
                                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                              </PARAMETERS>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:89646d24-e3bb-4126-aa85-2b8b5499d9d3">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmPageBufferCfg</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) for Page Buffer handling</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmPageBufferCfg是用于配置诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中分页缓冲区的属性，这些属性包括缓冲区的大小和地址，用于存储和管理诊断服务的响应数据，特别是在需要分页发送大量数据时。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmPageBufferCfg时，必须确保缓冲区大小足够存储预期的最大响应数据量；同时，缓冲区的地址应当避免与其他系统模块的内存区域冲突；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，还需要确保配置的属性与ECU的内存管理策略和硬件能力相匹配。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00775</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:29b874d4-c94b-4ec0-b8ba-e7c421574c24">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmPagedBufferEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Allow to enable or disable the Paged buffer mechanism.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmPagedBufferEnabled 是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的分页缓冲区功能，该功能允许在发送大量诊断响应数据时进行分页处理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保在需要传输大数据量的诊断服务中启用此功能；如果ECU的资源有限，需要评估开启分页缓冲区对内存和处理能力的影响；在配置时应考虑与Dcm的其他配置参数的兼容性和依赖性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">true = Paged buffer handling enabled
                                                false = Paged Buffer handling disabled</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00776</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:793e1c41-87d8-4c11-b71d-d924a19beadc">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmProcessingConditions</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration for mode arbitration functionality of the Dcm</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmProcessingConditions配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中处理不同诊断请求的条件，包括但不限于车辆速度、引擎状态等条件，以确保在适当的车辆状态下执行诊断服务。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmProcessingConditions时，必须确保所有条件与实际车辆状态检测机制相匹配，避免因条件设置不当导致诊断服务无法执行；此外，AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于处理条件的具体实现和支持程度可能有所不同，需要参考具体的AUTOSAR实现文档；在多条件组合时，应注意条件之间的逻辑关系，确保逻辑判断的准确性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00932</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:1006f33d-0597-4976-ab55-0c3007d1d130">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmModeCondition</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a mode condition or an environmental conditions which can be used as argument in DcmModeRules.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmModeCondition配置项用于定义诊断通信管理（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的模式条件，这些条件决定了诊断会话是否可以被激活或维持。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保DcmModeCondition与车辆的操作模式和状态兼容；在设计时需考虑所有可能的车辆状态和模式转换，以避免诊断会话在不适当的时间被激活；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于模式条件的定义和使用应严格遵守，以保证系统的安全性和可靠性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">One DcmModeCondition shall contain either one DcmSwcModeRef or one DcmBswModeRef or one DcmSwcSRDataElementRef.

                                                Please note that the Dcm acts as well as mode manager. Therefore the references DcmSwcModeRef or one DcmBswModeRef.
                                                might point to provided ModeDeclarationGroupPrototypes of the Dcm itself as well as to provided ModeDeclarationGroupPrototypes of other Bsw Modules or software components.

                                                In case of a configured DcmSwcModeRef or DcmBswModeRef only the DcmConditionType DCM_EQUALS or DCM_EQUALS_NOT are applicable.

                                                In case of DcmSwcSRDataElementRef all literals of DcmConditionType are possible.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00928</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:86467a0b-067d-4542-9b3a-ffa9813df904">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmConditionType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies what kind of comparison that is made for the evaluation of the mode condition.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmConditionType 用于定义诊断通信管理（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的不同条件类型，这些条件决定了诊断会话是否可以被启动或继续。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmConditionType时，需要确保所有条件类型与系统的安全和诊断需求相匹配；此配置项应与具体的诊断需求和策略紧密相关，避免设置不恰当的条件导致诊断功能失效；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于DcmConditionType的具体实现细节有严格规定，需遵循标准指导。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00929</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>DCM_EQUALS</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:4e1d2300-a93f-9414-4436-321ed8cc15ce">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DCM_EQUALS</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:428e28af-0b7b-9301-654b-23a7019bdefd">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DCM_EQUALS_NOT</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:86468a0b-067d-4542-9c3a-ffa9813df904">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmProcessingConditionMode</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies what kind of comparison that is made for the evaluation of the mode condition.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmProcessingConditionMode配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的处理条件模式，它决定了在特定条件下，诊断请求是否被接受或拒绝。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmProcessingConditionMode时，需要确保它与系统中的安全性和诊断策略相匹配；此外，应考虑到不同诊断会话模式下的处理条件，以及与其他模块的交互可能对处理条件产生的影响；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能有具体的枚举值和参数要求，需要根据标准文档进行准确配置。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01500</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>E_OK</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:4e1d2300-a93f-9414-4536-321ed8cc15ce">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>E_OK</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:428e29af-0b7b-9301-654b-23a7019bdefd">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>E_NOT_OK</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:54316525-84ea-4bbd-a904-2ad08a86db7c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmSwcModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the function to be called on check mode condition.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSwcModeRef配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中软件组件（Software Component）的模式引用，允许软件组件根据不同的诊断模式改变其行为。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmSwcModeRef时，确保引用的模式与软件组件的实际需求相匹配；此配置项对于实现基于模式的诊断服务至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对模式管理的支持和定义可能与早期版本有所不同，需要特别注意版本间的兼容性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00930</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
