                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmBswModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter references a mode of a ModeDeclarationGroupPrototype provided by a Basic Software Module used for the condition.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
