                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Please note that such ModeDeclarationGroupPrototype are owned by a Basic Software Module Description in the role providedModeGroup.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
