                              <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/KeyM/KeyMCertificate/KeyMCertificateElement</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f174de8d-c45a-431f-9783-a87c68902c74">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmSwcDataElementValue</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a compare value.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSwcDataElementValue配置项用于定义诊断服务中软件组件（Swc）数据元素的值，这些值可以是静态的或者通过诊断会话动态改变。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmSwcDataElementValue时，确保数据元素的类型与期望的诊断服务匹配；对于动态数据，需要实现适当的接口以在诊断会话中更新值；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应确保与诊断数据标识符（DID）管理和映射机制兼容。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01123</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <CHOICES>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:9b718096-a81d-49a8-b671-be37ef08231d">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmSwcDataElementArray</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a array compare value.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSwcDataElementArray配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中软件组件（Software Component, Swc）的数据元素数组，这些数据元素用于读取或更新车辆的诊断信息。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保数据元素的类型、大小和结构与诊断需求相匹配；数组中的数据元素应当遵循诊断服务的规范，例如UDS（统一诊断服务）；在配置数据元素数组时，应注意数据的内存映射和对齐要求，以确保诊断通信的正确性和效率。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01125</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:63b0f9f6-7ae6-4095-a834-8dfddc5e28b3">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmSwcDataElementArrayElement</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a array element compare value.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSwcDataElementArrayElement配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中软件组件数据元素的数组元素属性，这些属性包括数组元素的数据类型、大小和诊断访问权限等。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmSwcDataElementArrayElement时，需要确保数组元素的数据类型与实际软件组件中定义的类型一致；数组的大小和索引范围必须正确定义，以避免访问越界；诊断访问权限应根据安全和功能需求合理设置。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01129</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                                      <PARAMETERS>
                                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:675cde6e-4c87-4a72-8567-0524d4e3009b">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmSwcDataElementArrayElementIndex</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Index to an element of the compare value array.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSwcDataElementArrayElementIndex配置项用于定义诊断服务中，软件组件数据元素数组的特定元素索引，以便于访问数组中的单个数据项。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保索引值在数组的有效范围内；对于非数组类型的数据元素，此配置项不应使用；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循诊断服务的数据访问规则，确保配置的一致性和正确性。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01127</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3a6980fb-d527-4037-8fd0-71b1143e13b9">
                                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmSwcDataElementArrayElementValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                          <DESC>
                                            <L-2 L="EN">Value of an array element compare value.</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSwcDataElementArrayElementValue配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，软件组件（Software Component）数据元素数组的具体元素值，它允许对数组中每个元素进行精确的值设定。</L-2>
                                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保数组索引与实际软件组件中定义的数组大小一致，避免索引越界；该配置项的使用应符合诊断数据交换的具体需求，确保数据的准确性和有效性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于诊断数据的管理和配置有详细规范，需确保配置项的使用与标准一致。</L-2>
                                          </DESC>
                                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01128</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                          <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                      </PARAMETERS>
                                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:503627b8-ac28-4b76-b4cd-f81a94e36d94">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmSwcDataElementPrimitive</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a primitive compare value.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSwcDataElementPrimitive配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中，软件组件（Software Component）的基本数据元素。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保数据类型与实际应用需求一致，避免数据类型不匹配导致的运行时错误；在配置时应关注数据元素的访问权限和安全性需求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对此配置项的具体属性和使用方式有详细规定，应严格遵守。</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01124</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <PARAMETERS>
                                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3cba889c-c3ca-4eac-8879-23453899231a">
                                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmSwcDataElementPrimitiveValue</SHORT-NAME>
                                      <DESC>
                                        <L-2 L="EN">Primitive compare value.</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmSwcDataElementPrimitiveValue配置项用于定义诊断服务中，软件组件数据元素的原始值，这些值通常用于读取或设置ECU中的数据。</L-2>
                                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmSwcDataElementPrimitiveValue时，需要确保数据类型与软件组件中定义的数据类型一致；此外，还需注意数据的取值范围和精度要求，以避免在诊断通信过程中出现数据不匹配的问题；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于诊断数据元素的配置有详细的规范，需要遵循这些规范来确保诊断服务的正确性和可靠性。</L-2>
                                      </DESC>
                                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01126</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                                      <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                                  </PARAMETERS>
                                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                              </CHOICES>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3ff24719-16fa-4d1f-ae20-a5a7ba2a0912">
                          <SHORT-NAME>DcmModeRule</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of a mode rule which represents a logical expression with DcmModeConditions or other DcmModeRules as arguments.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmModeRule配置项用于定义诊断会话控制和安全访问等模式下，诊断服务是否可用的规则，确保在特定的诊断会话层次或安全访问级别下，只有授权的诊断服务被允许执行。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmModeRule时，需要确保规则与诊断服务的实际需求相匹配；对于每个诊断服务，都应该定义相应的模式规则，以避免在不适当的会话或安全级别下执行服务；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能对模式规则的表达方式和可用参数有具体的要求，需要遵循标准文档中的定义。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">All arguments are processed with the operator defined by DcmLogicalOperator, for instance:
                                                Argument_A AND Argument_B AND Argument_C</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00925</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a85c43c7-19e0-490e-808b-49cace0481e9">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmLogicalOperator</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter specifies the logical operator to be used in the logical expression. If the expression only consists of a single condition this parameter shall not be used.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmLogicalOperator 是一个配置项，用于定义诊断服务请求中多个条件之间的逻辑关系，例如“与”（AND）、“或”（OR）等，以支持复杂的服务请求条件组合。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmLogicalOperator时，确保逻辑运算符的使用与服务请求的条件逻辑相匹配；逻辑运算符的组合需要遵循AUTOSAR规范中定义的语法和语义；不当的逻辑运算符配置可能导致诊断服务无法正确执行或者产生不预期的行为。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00926</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>DCM_AND</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:fefc5495-19af-92b6-2f2c-2d2771214df4">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DCM_AND</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:a573e330-064c-93b1-6a64-9d9e0b2df702">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>DCM_OR</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b07cf2e6-febc-4d63-903f-f2ec5b44d785">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmModeRuleNrcValue</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Optional parameter which defines the NRC to be sent in case the mode rule condition is not valid.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmModeRuleNrcValue 用于定义在诊断通信控制模块（Dcm）中，当特定模式规则不满足时返回的负面响应代码（NRC）。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个模式规则关联的NRC符合ISO 14229标准中定义的错误代码；不正确的NRC设置可能导致诊断工具无法正确识别错误，影响车辆诊断过程；在配置时需考虑所有可能的模式规则和相应的诊断会话状态。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00949</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>255</MAX>
                              <MIN>1</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:ae40034a-47cb-4c70-b3b3-ddd06837faf0">
                              <SHORT-NAME>DcmArgumentRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This is a choice reference either to a mode condition or a an other mode rule serving as sub-expression.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00927</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REFS>
                                <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmProcessingConditions/DcmModeCondition</DESTINATION-REF>
                                <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmProcessingConditions/DcmModeRule</DESTINATION-REF>
                              </DESTINATION-REFS>
                            </ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b4462385-9cc5-4e87-8fe1-c8828539547b">
                  <SHORT-NAME>DcmGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Contains general configuration parameters valid for the entire Dcm module.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmGeneral是AUTOSAR Diagnostic Communication Manager (DCM) 模块的一部分，它包含了DCM模块的通用配置参数，例如诊断会话控制、安全访问、响应时间等。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmGeneral时，需要确保所有参数与项目的诊断需求相符合；参数的设置应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准的规范；在多个ECU中实现DCM时，应保持一致性以确保网络级诊断的互操作性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00822</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:19eb8b6b-01ed-4408-8f5d-479581f331a0">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDDDIDStorage</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This configuration switch defines, whether DDDID definition is stored non-volatile or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDDDIDStorage配置项用于定义诊断动态定义数据标识符（Dynamic Defined Data Identifier，DDDID）的存储属性，包括存储位置和存储条件，确保动态定义的数据可以在车辆诊断会话中被正确存储和访问。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保DDDID的存储机制符合诊断服务的要求；存储位置应当保证数据的持久性和安全性；在设计存储策略时，应考虑到可能的内存限制和对存储介质的写入次数限制。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: DDDID are stored non-volatile
                                        false: DDDID are only maintained volatile</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00971</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7755437e-b497-4977-96a0-8f388f3f4e39">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmDevErrorDetect 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）模块内部的开发错误检测机制。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产环境中通常禁用此功能以节省资源和提高性能；在开发和测试阶段，应启用此功能以便检测和报告潜在的错误；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，此配置项应当与系统的调试和诊断策略保持一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00823</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1322522a-3a6e-45c0-b93a-8fd273f3a770">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmRespondAllRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">If set to FALSE the Dcm will not respond to diagnostic request  that contains a service ID which is in the range from 0x40 to 0x7F or in the  range from 0xC0 to 0xFF (Response IDs).</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmRespondAllRequest配置项用于定义诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）是否应对所有接收到的诊断请求进行响应，无论它们的来源或状态。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmRespondAllRequest时，需要考虑安全和隐私问题，确保不会因响应所有请求而暴露敏感信息或功能；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应谨慎使用，以避免违反任何特定的通信协议规定；确保系统资源和性能在响应所有请求时不会受到影响。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00600</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:90c81c3b-00d3-4dc0-a23f-1152a767191d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmVersionInfoApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Preprocessor switch to enable or disable the output Version info of the functionality.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmVersionInfoApi 是一个配置选项，用于启用或禁用诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）中的版本信息API，允许软件组件提供其版本信息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保在配置时考虑到系统的诊断需求和兼容性；不恰当的启用或禁用可能影响诊断工具的功能；版本信息API的使用应遵循项目的软件开发指南和规范。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00821</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4aad3456-f83c-451f-aff6-5acefb2bc974">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmTaskTime</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Allow to configure the time for the periodic cyclic task. Please note: This configuration value shall be equal to the value in the RTE module.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmTaskTime配置项定义了诊断通信管理器（Diagnostic Communication Manager）模块中任务的调用周期，即Dcm主任务的执行频率。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值必须与实际操作系统任务的调度周期相匹配；配置值过小可能导致系统过载，过大可能影响诊断响应时间；在多任务系统中，需要确保DcmTaskTime与其他任务的调度策略协调一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">The AUTOSAR configuration standard is to use SI units, so this parameter is defined as float value in seconds. Dcm configuration tools must convert this float value to the appropriate value format for the use in the software implementation of Dcm.

                                        min:
                                        A negative value and zero is not allowed.

                                        upperMultiplicity:
                                        Exactly one TaskTime must be specified per configuration.

                                        lowerMultiplicity:
                                        Exactly one TaskTime must be specified per configuration.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_00820</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>0.01</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="OPEN">Inf</MAX>
                      <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="OPEN">0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2d207d9c-344d-45ea-8a97-24f2e987f465">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DcmHeaderFileInclusion</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Name of the header file(s) to be included by the Dcm module containing the used C-callback declarations.
                            Dcm_Callout_Stubs.h is generated by default and does not need to be configured separately.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DcmHeaderFileInclusion配置项用于指定在Diagnostics Communication Manager (DCM) 模块中包含的额外头文件，这些头文件可能包含用户定义的宏、类型定义或者外部函数声明。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置DcmHeaderFileInclusion时，确保包含的头文件与AUTOSAR标准兼容，不会引入非标准的依赖；头文件应当存在于项目的包含路径中，以避免编译错误；如果项目中使用了特定的编译器或者特殊的编译设置，需要确保这些头文件在这些环境下也能正确编译。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dcm_01019</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
